<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">LEV- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Wal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Walawi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Walawi</para>
  <para style="mt">WALAWI</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwe aya ya nkongo ye sula ya nkongo ye chitabu chino chakatatu cha Musa chikwitangwa Walawi, chagambilwa kugamba Chohile amwitanga Musa alonga naye mwe Dihema Dikukile. Chitabu chose chalanga ulozo mkulu wa sigilizi ziya Chohile awenkaga Waizulaeli na kulagana kugamba wadya nawadamanye viya vikungwa namalongozi ayo nawekale kwaizo (18.5 aya idya ilagizwe mwe chitabu cha Walumi 10:5.) Kwa vyose, mbuli injima mwe chitabu chino chalanga ukuka wakwe Chohile mwenye na ivyo wantu wakungwa kumvikila na kutoza hegu kutozesa wivano wawo naye, yudya nuyo eli “Mkuka ywa Izulaeli.” Kugamba yoyose akumlaviza ntambiko vyaungwa atende ivyo kuligana na ivyo vikungwa hegu sigilizi (sula 1-7), kugamba walavyantambiko ni budi watunywe na wowo wetunye ivyo vikungwa (sula 8-10) na kugamba chila yumwenga waiyo ijumuia ya Waizulaeli budi enege ivyovikudahika na chila chochose kichafu (sula 11-16), wenege na ubanasi wose wa wikazi wedi hegu miviko heikungwa (sula 17-27). Vikaheza Waizulaeli wenkigwa lagizo diya Yesu alahilize muunge mwiyayo enga ukweunga weye mwenye. Mwe sula ya 19:18, kaula Matayo sula ya 22:29. Sigilizi izo zikulanga msomi wa mazuwa yano zaoneka njeni zakuwakumbusa wantu wose kugamba wivano mgati mwa Chohile na wantu wakwe ni mbuli yedi na yakutozesa.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe malavyo ya kutikimya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />Zumbe kamwitanga Musa na kulonga naye mwe Dihema Dikukile, akagamba, <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />Wagambile Waizulaeli, uneva yumwenga ywenyu akegala lavyo dya ludimo kwa Chohile, namwigaile malavyo yenyu kulaila mwe zing'ombe zakwe hegu ngoto zakwe hegu mwembuzi zakwe mwenye.<verse eid="LEV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />Uneva lavyo nidya kutikimya dya ng'ombe namlavye njeku heina lema, na muigale ho lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile chani kwa kuzumilwa kulongozi kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Nawike mkono wako mlanga mo mtwi wo mnyama we dilavyo dyo kutikimya na dizumilwe kwachausa cha kusa masa. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Injeku na ichinjwe kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, na wana wa Haluni awo walavyantambiko nawaiguhe isakame na kuinyunyiziza isakame mnkanda ntendele zose ze nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko hajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Akaheza mntu uyo naisangule injeku iyo na kuikanta vihandehande. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Awo walavyantambiko welekwa wa Haluni nawawande nkuni mlanga mwe inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko na kujimba moto. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Vikaheza walavyantambiko awo nawaguhe viya ivihande vye nyama, umtwi na mavuta na kuvika mlanga mwe zinkuni mlanga mwe nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Mntu uyo nasunte kwa mazi utumbo ne viga vya kunyuma vyo mnyama uyo. Mlavyantambiko naditikimye idilavyo dyose mlanga mwe inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko. Idyo ni lavyo dya kutikimya kwa moto dina mhempe wedi wa kumuwagila Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />“Uneva lavyo dyakwe dyo kutkimya nadilavye mwe fyo dya ngoto hegu mbuzi, ivyo, nasagule ndolome hegu vulata hedina lema. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Na ichinjwe mwe intendele ya chenya ye nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko kulongozi kwa Zumbe, na wana wa Haluni mlavyantambiko na wanyunyize isakame mnkanda mose mwe inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Vikaheza mntu uyo nakante vihandehande, napagule umtwi hamwenga na mavuta yakwe, na mlavyantambiko navike mo moto mlanga mwe inchanja. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Mna utumbo ne viga vya kunyuma navisuntwe na mazi. Vikaheza mlavyantambiko nalavye vyose na kuvitikimywa mo moto mwe inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko. Idyo ni lavyo dya kutikimya dina mhempe ikumuwagila Zumbe.”<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />“Uneva amlaviza Zumbe kutenda lavyo dya kutikimya dya kadege usagule lavyo dya suwa hegu kasuwamanga. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Mlavyantambiko negale akadege ako kwe inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko, nakukanyosola umtwi wakwe na kuwoka mlanga mwe inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko. Isakame yakwe nainyunyize mnkanda mwe inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Iditundumilo dyakwe hamwenga no uzavu wakwe navyuse na kuvidula ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa we inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko kudya amaivu yakwikwa. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Ukajika natoze amawawa na kukatumbula, mna asekukakanta vihande vidi. Akaheza, mlavyantambiko nakoke katikime kose mlanga mwe inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko. Idyo nilavyo dya kutikimya dina mhempe wedi wa kumuwagila Zumbe.”<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya uhule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />Mntu yoyose akwigala lavyo dya uhule kwa Zumbe, lavyo idyo ditende dya unga usungigwe vyedi. Naujele mavuta ya mzeituni na ubani <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />nawegaile yumwenga mwa walavyantambiko awo wana wa Haluni. Uyo naguhe chifumba chimwenga cho uhule uwo nakuutikimya mwe nchanja yo kutimila malavyo. Chihendo icho nachilagise ichindedi kugamba malavyo ayo ni Zumbe Chohile, naho ni mhempe wedi wa kumuwagila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Chihendo chikusigala che dilavyo idyo dyo uhule nidya walavyantambiko Haluni na wanawe. Icho ni chihendo chikukise cha lavyo dikulavigwa kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />Uneva mntu anamlaviza Zumbe Chohile lavyo dya uhule hegu chintu chikazingwe mwe diziko, vyaungwa didamanywe kwa unga usungigwe vyedi. Nawigale migate idamanywe kwa mavuta ya zeituni, heigwaduswe hegu mandazi heyegwaduse hegu heikulugutwe mavuta.<verse eid="LEV 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />Uneva lavyo ukulavya ni dya mgate ukazingwe mwe lukalango, idyo naditende dya unga usungigwe uhanganywe na mavuta ya zeituni mna hedigwaduswe. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Migate iyo neibesulwebesule na kujuluzizwa mavuta, idyo ni lavyo dikuwagila kwa Zumbe.<verse eid="LEV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />Uneva lavyo ukulavya ni dya migate yambikwe mwe sufuliya, idyo naditende dya unga usungigwe vyedi na dijelwa mavuta ya zeituni. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Nomwigaile Zumbe lavyo dya uhule didamanyizwe ivintu ivyo nomwigaile mlavyantambiko, navigale kwe inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko za kutikimya. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Mlavyantambiko naguhe chihendo che dilavyo idyo chikulagisa kugamba lavyo dyose idyo nidya Zumbe, nakitikimye ichihendo icho mlanga mwe inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko. Mhempe wakwe naumuwagile Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Chihendo chikusigala che dilavyo idyo dyo uhule nidya walavyantambiko Haluni na wanawe, icho ni chihendo chikukise, cha lavyo dikulavigwa kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />Lavyo dyodyose dya unga nomwigaile Zumbe vyaungwa didamanywe hedigwaduswe, kwaviya ni mwiko kujeseza ugwadu hegu uchi mwe malavyo yakulavigwa kwa Zumbe Chohile kwa moto. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Wadaha kumwigaila ayo hamwenga na ulozo wa nkongo, mna hukungwa kuvitikimywa mlanga mwe inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko enga mhepe wedi ukumuwagila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Nojele munyu mwe chila lavyo dya unga, kwaviya munyu ni lagiso dya lagano mgati mwako na Chohile. Vyaungwa ujele munyu mwa malavyo yose. <verse eid="LEV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />Umo ukegala lavyo dyodyose kwa Zumbe dya malimbulo ya ulozo wako, nodilavye dikatenda dyokigwa mwa maiso yakwe hegu noulavye mwemigate idamanywe kwa unga usungigwe vyedi. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Jela mavuta ya mizeituni na kujela ubani idyo ni lavyo dya unga kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Mlavyantambiko naguhe chihendo kulagisa kugamba lavyo idyo chindedi nidya Zumbe Chohile. Natikimwe kihendo icho mwe nchanja yo kutikimiza malavyo yatende malavyo yavigwe kwa Zumbe.<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya wikazi wa utondowazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />Uneva mntu alavya ng'ombe yakwe saviya lavyo dya kulombeza utondowazi, dikatenda njeku hegu ng'ombe fyele, yongigwa itende heina lema. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Naike umkono wakwe kulanga ko mtwi wo mnyama uyo na kumchinja ho lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile kulongozi kwa Zumbe. Walavyantambiko, awo wana wa Haluni waimyage isakame mwe zintendele zose ze inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko yo kutikimya. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Mlavyantambiko naguhe mavuta yose yakugubika ntendele za kundani na yelamnga mo utumbo wo mnyama uyo wa malavyo yo kulombeza utondowazi kwa Zumbe Chohile. Mlavyantambiko nayatikimye enga lavyo dikulavigwa kwa Zumbe Chohile kwa kutikimya. <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />Iviya naguhe izifigo mbili na mavuta yakwe hamwenga ne chihendo chedi che idini na mavuta yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Walavyantambiko nawavikitimye vyose mlanga mwe inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko hamwenga na malavyo yatikimye yatende malavyo yakulavigwa kwa Zumbe Chohile. Mhempe umo wakatikimya nautende wakumuwagila Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />Uneva ngoto hegu mbuzi yajesezwa saviya lavyo dya kulombeza utondowazi kwa Zumbe Chohile, yadaha itende fyele hegu ngosi, mna yaungwa isekutenda na lema. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Uneva mntu alavya mwana ngoto, kutenda lavyo dyakwe ivyo namlavize kulongozi kolwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />Naike umkono wakwe mo mtwi wo uyo mnyama na kumchinja kulongozi kwe Dihema Dikukile. Walavyantambiko awo wana wa Haluni nawanyunyize isakame yakwe ntendele zose nne zo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />ukaheza kulaila mo mnyama uyo akulavigwa lavyo dya utondowazi kulavizwa Zumbe Chohile kwa kutikimya. Ivyo, mlavyantambiko namlavize Zumbe mavuta yakwe na mchila hamwenga na mavuta yakwe yose ukantigwe hajihi nomgongo na mavuta yose yakugubika utumbo, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />figo zakwe mbili na mavuta yakwe nechihendo chedi chedini na mavuta yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Mlavyantambiko navitikimnye vyose ivyo mlanga mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko saviya nkande ya kutikimya ikulavizwa kwa Zumbe.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />“Uneva ni mntu akulavya mbuzi, ivyo nailavye kulongozi ko lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />Aike umkono wakwe mlanga mo mtwi wo mnyama uyo nakumchinja kulongozi kwe Dihema Dikukile. Walavyantambiko awo wana wa Haluni, nawainyunyize isakame ntendele zose nne ze inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />akaheza amlavize Zumbe Chohile amavuta yose ya kugubika utumbo, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />figo zakwe mbili na mavuta yakwe, na chihendo chedi chedini na mavuta yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Mlavyantambiko navitikimnywe vyose mlanga mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko saviya nkande ikulavigwa kwa Chohile. Na umhempe wakwe umo ikatikimnywa na imuwagile Chohile. Mavuta yose ni ya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />Dino ni lagizo dikungwa ditozeswe ni nyuwe na welekwe wenyu wose mazuwa yose hohose namwikale kugamba, ni mwiko Myahudi kudya mavuta hegu sakame.”<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s">Lavyo kwa chausa cha wavu hewe kambile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />Zumbe kamgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />Wagambile wantu wa Izulaeli kugamba mntu yoyose nadamanye wavu hegu kadamanya mbuli yoyose ilemezwe mwa malagizo aungwa adamanye yano.<verse eid="LEV 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />Uneva Mlavyantambiko Mkulu nuyo adamanye umlema na kuwajela wantu mwe masa, ivyo uyo egale njeku heina lema itende lavyo dya kusa masa kukalavya lavyo kwa Zumbe kwachausa cho wavu wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Naigale iyo injeku kolwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile, naike umkono wakwe mlanga mo mtwi we njeku iyo na kuichinja hajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Akaheza Mlavyantambiko Mkulu naguhe chihendo cha sakame nakuigala mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Natweze ididole dyakwe mwe isakame iyo na kuimyagila nkanana mfungate kulongozi kwedipaziya dikusenta Hantu Hakukile na Hantu Hakukise. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Akaheze Mlavantambiko naguhe chihendo cha sakame na kuihaka mwa mahembe ye nchanja yo kuvunkiziza ubani mwe Dihema Dikukile. Akaheza sakame isigale naitile hasi kuse kwe chitako cho wani wo kulaviza ntambiko ikujesezwa kutikimya malavyo, idya ihajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Akaheza nause amavuta yose, mavuta yakugubika utumbo, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />nezifigo mbili na mavuta ye mlanga mwakwe, ne chihendo chedi chedini na mavuta yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />Mlavyantambiko naguhe mavuta ayo na kuyatikimywa mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko ukujesezwa kutikimiza malavyo. Nadamanye seivyo adamanye na mavuta yo mnyama achinjigwe kwa chausa cha kulombeza utondowazi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Mna naguhe umkota, inyama yose na umtwi na iviga vya kunyuma no utumbo na mavi yakwe, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />kugamba nyama yose isigaile noigale kuse kwe nkambi kwechivu uko maivu yakwitilwa, naye naitikimye kwa moto aho mlanga mwe nkuni.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />Uneva wantu wose wa Izulaeli wadamanya masa hewe kambile kwa kudamanya chintu chilemezwe mwedilagizo dya Zumbe Chohile nawengile mwe mlema hata hegu hawavimanyize wadamanya masa, <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />aho nawabunkuile amasa ayo, wantu wose nawalavye njeku itende lavyo dya kusa masa. Nawaigale kwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Wadalahala vilongozi wa wantu wa Izulaeli nawaike mikono yawo mlanga momtwi waidya injeku, wakaheza nawaichinjwe kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Mlavyantambiko Mkulu naguhe chihendo che sakame ya iyo injeku kuigala mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />natweze ididole dyakwe mwe iyo isakame na kuimyagila nkanana mfungate kulongozi kwe dipaziya dikusenta Hantu Hakukile na Hantu Hakukise. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Akaheza, naguhe chihendo che sakame na kuihaka mwa mahembe yenchanja yo kuvunkiziza ubani imndani mwe Dihema Dikukile, na kwitila idya isigale hasi hechitako che nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko zo kutikimya, idya ihajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Akaheza naguhe amavuta yose na kutikimya mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />Ivyo, mlavyantambiko nadamanye seviya adamanye mweidya injeku yo kusa masa yakwe mwenye, kwa kudamanya ivyo nawadamanyize wivano nawo nawalekeilwe. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Akaheza naguhe inyama isigale ye njeku iyo nakuigala kuse kwe nkambi na kuitikimya, saviya atikimye idya intuhu. Dino ni lavyo dya kusa masa kwa wantu wose wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />Uneva ni chilongozi adamanye masa na kuwoneka kabalanga dimwenga mwa malagizo ya Zumbe Chohile hekambile nengile mwe mlema, <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />aho nabunkuile amasa yakwe, negale lavyo dyakwe dya vulata hedina lema. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Naike umkono wakwe mlanga mo mtwi we divulata na kudichinja ntendele ya chenya yo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, kudya wanyama wa malavyo wakuchinjizwa. Dino ni lavyo dya kusa masa. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Mlavyantambiko natweze ididole dyakwe mwe sakame yo mnyama uyo na kuihaka mwa mahembe yo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko yo kutikimya na kuitila hasi he chitako cho uwo wani idya isigale. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Akaheza atikimye amavuta yose mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, saviya atikimye amavuta ya wanyama wachinjigwe kwachausa cha malavyo ya kulombeza wivano kwa Zumbe Chohile. Kwasila ino mlavyantambiko nadamanye mviko wa utowazi kwachausa cha uyo mntu na Zumbe, mntu uyo nalekeilwe amasa yakwe.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />Uneva mntu yumwenga mwa wantu wa Izulaeli kadamnya masa hekambile na kubalanga sigilizi ya Zumbe nakuwoneka na mlema, <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />aho nabunkuile kugamba kakola masa he yekambile, negale kwachausa cha lavyo dyakwe ntogota heina lema. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Naike umkono wakwe mlanga mo mtwi we ntogota iyo na kuichinja ntendele ya chenya yo uwa wo kulaviza ntambiko, kudya wanyama wa malavyo ya kutikimya wakuchinjizwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Mlavyantambiko naguhe chihendo cha sakame ichingigwe mwe bakuli natweze ididole dyakwe mwe sakame yo mnyama uyo, na kuihaka mwa mahembe yo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, na kuitila hasi he chitako cho wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Akaheza ause amavuta yakwe yose, saviya amavuta yakuswa mwa wanyama wakuchinjwa kwachausa cha kulombeza utondowazi, na kuitikimya mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. Mhempe wakwe umo ikatikimya naumuwagile Zumbe Chohile. Kwa sila ino mlavyantambiko nadamanye mviko wa utondowazi kwa chausa cha uyo mntu naye nalekeilwe.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />Uneva mntu uyo negale mwana ngoto kwachausa cha masa, yaungwa itende ntogota heina lema. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Naike umkono wakwe mlanga mo mtwi we ngoto iyo na kuichinja ntendele ya chenya yo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, kudya wanyama wa malavyo yo kutikimya wakuchinjizwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Akaheza Mlavyantambiko naguhe chihendo cha sakame ichingigwe mwe bakuli nakutweze ididole dyakwe mwe isakame yo mnyama uyo na kuihaka mwa mahembe yo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, idya isigale naitile hasi he chitako cho wani wo kulaviza ntambiko idya isigale. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Akaheza nayause amavuta yose saviya akusa mavuta ya lavyo dya ngoto ya kulombeza utondowazi kwa Chohile. Mlavyantambiko naitikimye mlanga mo wani hamwenga na malavyo yakulavigwa kwa Chohile kwa moto. Mlavyantambiko uyo namdamanyize mviko wa wivano mntu uyo kwa Chohile. Mntu uyo nalekeilwe masa yakwe.<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kudamanya mwe malavyo ya kusa masa yesimane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />Malavyo ya kusa masa yakungwa kudamanywa zikalaila mbuli sa zino. Mntu yoyose akalemela kulavya ukuzi kwechitala mwe mbuli yoyose awone hegu amanyize ilaile, natende na masa ivyo aungwa akantilwe.<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />Hegu mntu yoyose mgati mwenyu akejela mwe masa heyakambile, kwa kukufya chintu chochose chizavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile saviya mnyama yoyose ywa kumbago hegu akudimwa afile hegu wadudu natende na wavu.<verse eid="LEV 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />Hegu mntu anakufya chintu chochose nachimtende mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile, hekambile, aho nabunkuile natende na mlema.<verse eid="LEV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />Hegu, mntu anelisa kutenda chochose chiya, chedi hegu chihiye, enga viya wakudamanya wantu hewe kufanyanya, aho akubunkwila natende na mlema.<verse eid="LEV 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />“Uneva mntu anabunkula kugamba ana mlema kwa kudamanya mbuli izo aungwa aulonge molumpe umlema uwo, <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />na kanto dyo mlema wakwe aungwa amwigaile Zumbe Chohile mwana ngoto hegu mbuzi ntogota itende lavyo dyakwe dya kusa masa. Mlavyantambiko namdamanyize mviko wa wivano kwa Zumbe kwachausa cha masa ya uyo mntu.”<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />“Uneva hana lavyo dya ngoto hegu mbuzi, aungwa amwigaile Zumbe lavyo dya kusa mlema wasuwa waidi hegu machinda maidi ya wasuwamanga, kamwenga kwachausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa na akatuhu kwachausa cha lavyo dya kutikimya. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Nawegale kwa mlavyantambiko, naye namlavye uyumwenga atende lavyo dya kusa masa kwa kukagogodola isingo hekusa umtwi, <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />na kunyunyiza sakame mwezimbembe zo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, intuhu nainyunyize mwechitako cho wani. Idyo naditende lavyo dya kusa masa. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Akaheza nakalavye kadya kadege kakaidi saviya lavyo dya kutikiywa, kuligana na malagizo. Kwa isila ino Mlavyantambiko nalavye lavyo kwachausa cha mviko wa wivano wo mntu uyo, naye nalekeilwe.”<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />“Uneva mntu uyo hana wasuwa waidi hegu machinda maidi ya wasuwamanga enga lavyo dyakwe dyakusa masa, ivyo, negale chilo imwenga ya unga saviya lavyo dya kusa masa. Mna asekujela mavuta hegu ubani kwaviya idyo ni lavyo dya kusa masa. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Namwigaile mlavyantambiko, naye naguhe unga uwo fumba dimwenga kulagisa kugamba lavyo dyose nidya Zumbe Chohile na kuutikimya mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, hamwenga na malavyo akulavizwa Zumbe Chohile kwa moto. Idyo nilavyo dya kusa masa. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Kwa sila ino mlavyantambiko namdamanyize uyo mntu mviko wa wivano kwa Zumbe Chohile naye nalekeilwe amasa yakwe. Unga ukusigala nautende wa mlavyantambiko, saviya vikutendeka mwe lavyo dya nkande.”<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavyo ya maliho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />Zumbe kamgamba Musa. <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />“Uneva mntu yoyose anabalanga kwa kutenda wavu hemanyize kwa kuleka kulavya vintu vikukile akulavizwa Zumbe, negale ndolome hegu vulata hedina lema kwa Zumbe saviya lavyo dya maliho. Yombe dyakwe na dihimwe kuligana na chihimo chikigwe mwe Dihema Dikukile. Idyo ni lavyo dya kusa mlema. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Aungwa alavye maliho nendile henati kuliha na chongezeko cha fungu dimwenga mwe milongo mishano mlavyantambiko, mlavyantambiko naye namlavye umnyama uyo saviya lavyo dya kusa mlema kwachausa cha uyo mntu, naye nalekeilwe.”<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />“Mntu yoyose anatende wavu hemanyize kwa kubalanga lagizo dyodyose dya Zumbe, uyo ana masa naho aungwa alihe maliho yo mlema wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Aungwa egale kwa mlavyantambiko ndolome hegu vulata hedina lema, kwachausa cha maliho yo wavu wakwe. Yombe dyakwe diligane nechihimo chikigwe mwe Dihema Dikukile. Mlavyantambiko nalavye lavyo kwachausa cha wavu wa yudya mntu adamanye hekambile, naye nalekeilwe. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Ayo ni maliho ya kusa masa ya mlema adamanye mntu kwa Zumbe.”<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />“Uneva mntu anakola masa kwa kumhituka Zumbe kwa kumdanta mnyawe mwe chintu ekiye kwake hegu kumbaila hegu kulemela kumvuziza ichintu icho ana mlema. <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />Hegu kalondola chintu cha mnyawe chagile nakugamba hachiwone, hegu kwelisa udanti hegu adamanya mbuli za wavu, mntu uyo ana mlema. <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />Uneva mntu uyo kakola masa na kutenda na mlema sauwo, aungwa avuze chochose apatile kwa kuswesa uchindedi. Mwe dizuwa nabunkulwe kugamba kadamanya ivyo. Aungwa amvuzize umwenye ivintu ivyo. <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />Hegu chochose elisize kwa udanti, aungwa alihe ichintu icho jejeje na kongezeza fungu dimwenga mwe mashano mwe dizuwa dyokulavya lavyo dyakwe dyo mlema. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Akaheza namwigaile mlavyantambiko saviya lavyo dya maliho kwa Zumbe, ndolome hegu vulata hedina lema. Idiyombe dya maliho dyo mnyama uyo dyaungwa diligane na maliho yekigwe mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Mlavyantambiko nalavye malavyo ya kusa masa, kwa kudamanya ivyo mntu uyo nalekeilwe amasa yakwe yose.”<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo matahu mwe malavyo ya kutikimya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />Zumbe kamgamba Musa. <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />Yano nayo malagizo mwe malavyo nayatikimye mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. Malavyo ayo yasigaile mlanga mo wani wo chilo chose, moto ukonkanywe usekufa. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Akaheza mlavyantambiko, akatenda kavala suche zakwe za ulavyantambiko, na putula yakwe vidamanywe kwa suche yedi ing'aile ilukigwe, naguhe maivu na kuyaika mnkanda mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Akaheza kuhitwila izi suche zakwe aguhe yadya amaivu na kuyegala kwechivu kuse kwe nkambi. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Umoto mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko waungwa ujendeleze kwaka, naho ni mwiko use kukomwa. Chila zuwa nomtondo mlavyantambiko naike nkuni mo moto, mlanga mwakwe naike malavyo ya kutikimya. Akaheza aho naike idilavyo dya kulombeza utondowazi kwa Zumbe <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Umoto waungwa ujendeleze kwaka mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko mazuwa yose, ni mwiko use kukomwa.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo matuhu mwe malavyo ya uhule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />“Yano nayo malagizo ya malavyo ya uhule. Welekwa wa Haluni nawo wana udahi wa kumlaviza Zumbe idilavyo idyo mlanga mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Mlavyantamiko naguhe fumba dimwenga dya unga usungigwe vyedi uhanganywe na mavuta ya mizeituni na ubani na kujelwa mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. Fumba idyo nadilagise kugamba malavyo ayo yose chindedi niya Zumbe Chohile. Umhempe wakwe wedi umo ukatikimywa naumwelele Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Udya usigale Haluni na wanawe naudamanya migate heigwaduswe na kuidya hantu hakukile, mo uwa we Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Kumbuka kugamba malavyo yano yo uhule yakuka usekudamanywa kwa kugwaduswa. Siwenka unga uwo walavyantambiko saviya chihendo chawo kulaila mwa malavyo wakunilaviza kwa moto. Idyo ni lavyo dikukise, saviya vili malavyo ya kusa wavu na maliho kwachausa cha masa. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Chila chipindi nachize chila mlukolo ywa Haluni ywa chilume nadye saviya ujendelezo wa chihendo cha lavyo dya nkande ilavigwe kwa Zumbe. Mntu mtuhu yoyose na kufye idilavyo dye nkande yo koka augwa atende mkuka, hegu sivyo abanika.”<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />Iviya, Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />“Yano ni malagizo mwe chipindi cho kuwasenta walavyantambiko Haluni na wanawe. Mwe dizuwa nasentwe, nalavye saviya lavyo kwa Zumbe unga chilo imwenga mwa malavyo ya nkande ya chila zuwa, nusu nomtondo nusu naho nechisingi. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Yaungwa yahanganywe na mavuta ya mizeituni na kokwa mwe tanuli akaheza awigala ukatatenda vibesu na kuilavya saviya lavyo dya nkande, na umhempe we dilavyo dyakwe naumwagile Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Kwa chipindi chose chikutimila lavyo dino didamanywe ni chila mwelekwa ywa Haluni akusankana saviya Mlavyantambiko Mkulu yokigwe itikimye tiki saviya lavyo dikulavigwa kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Lavyo dyodyose dya nkande dilavigwe ni mlavyantambiko dyose naditikimye, dise kudigwa.”<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo matuhu mwe malavyo ya kusa masa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />Zumbe kamgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />“Mgambile Haluni na wanawe amalagizo yano kwachausa cha malavyo ya kusa masa. Mnyama ywa lavyo dya kusa masa achinjwe ahadya hentendele ya chenya yo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, kudya wanyama wa kulavigwa malavyo ya kutikimya wakutikimizwa. Dino ni lavyo dikukise. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Mlavyantambiko akulavya idilavyo dyo mnyama uyo, nuyo akungwa adidye mo uwa we Dihema Dikukile, hantu hakukile kulongozi kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Mntu yoyose hegu mnyama nakufye inyama yedilavyo idyo aungwa atende mkuka, hegu sivyo nabanike. Suche yoyose na itikilwe ni sakame yo mnyama uyo yaungwa ifuilwe hantu hakukile. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Lavyo idyo dinambikilwa mwe viya vya ulongo, viya ivyo navitulwe. Mna unevya iviya vidamanywa kwa shaba vyaungwa visuntwe na kuzuguzwa kwa mazi. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Mlukolo yoyose ywa chilume ywa mlavyantambiko adaha kudya idilavyo idyo dikukise. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Mna uneva sakame ya lavyo dyodyose dya kusa masa digalwa mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, inyama isekudingwa, itikimye tiki.”<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo matuhu mwe malavyo ya maliho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />“Yano ni malagizo mwe malavyo ya maliho, malavyo ayo yakukisa. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Mnyama ywa lavyo dya maliho nachinjwe ntendele ya chenya yo wani ahadya hokulaviza ntambiko, hantu hakuchinjizwa wanyama wa malavyo ya kutikimya na isakame yakwe nainyunyizwe mwe zintendele zose zo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Mavuta yakwe yose na mavuta yo mchila na mavuta yakubike utumbo nayauswe na kutikimya, <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />hamwenga nezifigo mbili na mavuta yakwe, na chihendo chedi che idini na mavuta yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Mlavyantambiko natikimye ivintu ivyo mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko saviya lavyo akulavizwa Zumbe Chohile. Idyo ni lavyo dya maliho. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Mlukolo yoyose ywa chilume ywa mlavyantambiko adaha kudya, mna augwa adile mndani mo uwa hantu hakukile, kwaviya lavyo idyo dikukisa. <verse eid="LEV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />Malagizo ni yamwe mwe lavyo dya kusa masa na lavyo dya maliho. Mlavyantambiko akulavya intambiko ye dilavyo idyo nuyo naguhe inyama iyo. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Mlavyantambiko akulavya lavyo dya kutikimya kwachausa cha mntu yoyose nuyo naguhe umkota wo mnyama uyo. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Malavyo ya vintu vidamanywe kulawana na unga, vyokigwe mwe moto hegu kwambikwa, ivyo navitende vya mlavyantambiko akulavya idilavyo dya maliho. <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />Mna malavyo yose yalavigwe kwa vintu vilawane na uhule nayatende yahanganywa na mavuta ya mizeituni hegu bule hevyambikwe, nivya welekwa wa Haluni, nawo nawenkigwe viligane.”<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo matuhu mwe malavyo ya kulombeza Utondowazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />Yano ni malagizo ya malavyo ya kulonda utondowazi yakulavigwa kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Uneva mntu alavya lavyo idyo kwa kumtogola Chohile, negale mnyama na migate heigwaduswe ihanganywe na mavuta na mandazi heyegwaduswe yahanganywe na mavuta na migate idamanywe kwa unga usungigwe vyedi na kuhanganywa na mavuta. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Hamwenga na malavyo yakwe yo utondowazi kwa Chohile negale mandazi yagwaduswe. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Mlavyantambiko namlavize Zumbe Chohile kulaila mwe chila fungu kulaila mwa amafungu ayo amane, yakusigala nayatende ya uyo mlavyantambiko alavize intambiko iyo yo kulonda utondowazi. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Inyama yedilavyo idyo dyo kulombeza utondowazi naidigwe mwedizuwa idyo ikulavigwa, haleke hata chihendo chochose, kubula mtondo zuwa dikutimila.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />“Hegu wegala malavyo kwachausa cha kuchintiza cheliso, hegu kulavya kwa kunga, nadidigwe mwedizuwa idyo dilavigwe, mna icho nachisigale chadaha chidigwe mwe dizuwa dikutimila. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Mna nyama yoyose yedilavyo idyo ikusigala kubula zuwa dya katatu yaungwa itikimnywe. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Uneva nyama yoyose ye dilavyo dyo kulombeza utondowazi kwa Zumbe inadigwa mwe zuwa dya katatu, Chohile hadizumile idilavyo dya uyo mntu. Idilavyo idyo hadihokelwe naho haimwambize mntu alavize, nyama iyo ni ihizo na mntu yoyose naidye nakantilwe ni Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />Chihendo che nyama iyo yo kulombezeza wivano chinakufya chintu chizavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile chisekudigwa, mna vyaungwa chitikimye tiki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 7:19">“Mwe nyama ntuhu yose isigaile mntu achumile moyo mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile adaha kudya, <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />mna uneva mntu yoyose yudya hechumile mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile anaidya inyama iyo ilavigwe lavyo dya utondowazi, nengaswe na wantu wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Mntu akukufya chintu chochose chizavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile, chikatenda ni chamntu hegu mnyama hegu chintu chochose chikwihiza, uneva anadya inyama ye dilavyo ilavigwe kwachausa cha kulombeza utondowazi kwa Chohile, mntu uyo nengaswe na wantu wakwe.” <verse eid="LEV 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />Zumbe kamgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />“Wagambile Waizulaeli vino. Msekudya mavuta ya ng'ombe, hegu ya ngoto, hegu ya mbuzi. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Mavuta ya mnyama yoyose afile mwenye hegu mnyama akomigwe ni makala ya kumbago yasekudigwa, mna yadaha kudamanyizwa mbuli ntuhu. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Mntu yoyose na adye mavuta ya mnyama yalavigwe saviya lavyo dya kutikimya kwa Zumbe Chohile nasentwe na wantu wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Naho msekujeza kudya sakame itende ya mnyama hegu wadege hohose namwikale. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Mntu yoyose anadya sakame yoyose, nanimwingase kulaila mwa wantu wangu.”<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />Chohile kamgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />“Wagambile wantu wa Izulaeli vino, Mntu yoyose nalavye lavyo dya kulombeza utondowazi kwa Chohile aungwa amwinke Zumbe chihendo chedilavyo idyo ditende lavyo. <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />Egale kwa mikono yakwe mwenye saviya lavyo dya kutikimya kwa moto. Egale mavuta yo mnyama hamwenga ne chifuwa na kuvinula kulanga saviya chilagiso cha kumlaviza Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Mlavyantambiko nayatikimye amavuta yose mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, mna ichifuwa nachitende cha Haluni na wanawe walavyantambiko. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Chiga cha kulume cha kunyuma cho mnyama alavigwe saviya lavyo dya kulombeza utondowazi kwa Chohile enkigwe mlavyantambiko, <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />chiga cha cho mnyama uyo ni cha mlavyantambiko mwelekwa ywa Haluni yudya akulavya isakame na mavuta ye dilavyo dyo kulombeza utondowazi kwa Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Ichifuwa nechiga cha kulume cha kunyuma cho mnyama wedilalavyo dyo kulombeza utondowazi, Zumbe Chohile kalagiza wamwinke mlavyantambiko Haluni na wanawe kwaviya wekiwa ichihendo icho chitende chawo mazuwa yose. <verse eid="LEV 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Chino ni chihendo kwa chausa cha Haluni na wanawe kulaila mwa malavyo yakulavigwa kwa Zumbe Chohile kwa moto kukongela mwedizuwa diya wasentagwa watende walavyantambiko kwa Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Mwe dizuwa diya wasentigwe kwa kuhakwa mavuta, Zumbe Chohile kawalagiza wana wa Waizulaeli kuwenka ichihendo chino cha malavyo. Ni lagizo kugamba wantu wa Waizulaeli wawenke walavyantambiko ichihendo icho mazuwa yose.<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />“Ivyo, ayo nayo malagizo ya malavyo ya kutikimya na malavyo ya uhule na malavyo ya kusa masa na malavyo ya kusa malema na malavyo ya kulombeza utondowazi kwa Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />Zumbe Chohile amwinkaga Musa izisigilizi zino kolugulu lwa Sinai mwe dizuwa diya awalagizaga wantu Waizulaeli wamwigaile malavyo yawo kwedijangwa dya Sinai.”<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s">Kusentwa kwa kuhakwa mavuta kwa Haluni na wanawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />Chohile kamgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />“Wegale Haluni na wanawe ko lwili lwe Dihema Dikukile kulongozi kwangu naho uguhe suche za ulavyantambiko na mavuta yakukile na njeku ya lavyo dya kusa masa na ndolome mbili na ntangulu ya migate heigwaduse. <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />Ukaheza, wachisanye wantu wa Waizulaeli hamwenga kulongozi ko lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile.”<verse eid="LEV 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Musa niyo adamanya saviya Zumbe amlagize adamanye, wantu wa Izulaeli wose weze wadugane kulongozi kwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Musa niyo awagamba, “Vino nivyo Zumbe Chohile achilagize chidamanye.”<verse eid="LEV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Aho Musa niyo awegala Haluni na wanawe na kuwasunta kwa mazi. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Akaheza niyo amvisa Haluni shati ntali na kuinyinya kwa msipi, na nkazu ibuluu, na kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa kasuche katalizwe na msipi ulukigwe kwa untanda na kuutaliza mwechigudi. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Akaheza aika kakwiji kamwechifuwa na mndani mwakwe ajela mayuwe maidi yakwitangwa ulimu na sumimu ya kulonda ulamuzi kwa Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Akaheza amvisa Haluni chilemba ko mtwi, na ntendele ya kulongozi kwe chilemba kaika kabati ka zahabu kakulagisa kugamba kasentwa kwa Chohile, saviya Zumbe amlagize.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Akaheza Musa niyo aguha mavuta yakukile na kudihaka Idihema ne vintu vyose vyendile umo mndani, na kwa sila ino kavikukiza kulongozi kwa Zumbe vintu vyose vyendile umo mndani. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Niyo anyunyiza chihendo cha mavuta ayo mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko nkanana mfungate ne viya vyose, kalai kulu ne chitako chakwe, kwachausa cha kuvikukiza kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Ivyo naho Musa kamjululiza Haluni mavuta yakukile mo mtwi chani kumkukiza. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Akaheza, Musa awegala wana wa Haluni kulongozi na kuwavisa mashati matali na kutaliza misipi mwe vigudi vyawo, na kuwavisa nkofiya mwe mitwi yawo, saviya Zumbe alagize.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Akaheza Musa niyo egala njeku ya malavyo kwachausa cha kusa masa, Haluni na wanawe waika imikono yawo mlanga mo mtwi we injeku iyo. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Musa niyo aichinja na kuchinga sakame mwe bakuli, kaguha chihendo cha sakame na kuihaka kwa dole dyakwe mwa mahembe yo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, kwachausa cha kuukukiza. Sakame isigale aitila hasi he chitako cho wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. Kwa sila iyo kaukukiza. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Ukaheza, Musa kaguha mavuta yose ye motumbo na ntendele yedi ye chihendo che idini, hamwenga ne zifigo zose mbili na mavuta yakwe na kuvitikimya mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Mna niyo aguha inyama ye injeku no mkota wakwe no utumbo na mavi yakwe, na kuvitikimya kuse kwe nkambi, saviya Zumbe alagize.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Akaheza Musa egala ndolome ya lavyo dya kutikimya, Haluni na wanawe niyo waika imikono yawo mlanga mo mtwi we iyo indolome. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Musa kaichinja na kuchinga sakame mwe bakuli nakuinyunyiza ntendele zose zo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Kaisenga handehande iyo indolome, na kuvitikimya hamwenga no umtwi na mavuta, mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, saviya Zumbe alagize. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Umo henati kuvyoka ivintu ivyo kasunta utumbo na mazi hamwenga neviga vyakwe vya kunyuma na kuvitikimya hamwenga nevihendo ivituhu mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko saviya lavyo dya kutikimya. Umhempe wakwe umo ikatikimya wamuwagila Zumbe, Musa niyo adamanya saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Akaheza Musa egala ndolome ntuhu kwa chausa cha kuwasenta watende walavyantambiko kwachausa cha Chohile. Haluni na wanawe waika imikono yawo mlanga mo mtwi wa iyo indolome. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Musa kaichinja na kuchinga sakame mwe bakuli na kuguha chihendo cha sakame na kuihaka kumpezo kwedigutwi dya kulume dya Haluni, na mwedidole dyakwe dikulu dyo mkono wakwe wa kulume, na mwe didole dyakwe idikulu dye chiga cha kulume. <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Akaheza awegala kulongozi wanawe dya Haluni na kuwakuluguta ichihendo che isakame mmpezo mwa magutwi yawo ya kulume, na mwamadole yawo amakulu ya kulume ye mikono, na mwa madole yawo amakulu ya kulume ya mweviga. Akaheza sakame isigale, Musa kainyunyiza ntendele zose zo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Niyo aguha amavuta yose, mchila hamwenga na mavuta yakwe, mavuta yose yakugubika utumbo na chihendo chedi cheidini, hamwenga ne zifigo zose mbili na mavuta yakwe, nechiga cha kulume cha kunyuma che iyo indolome. <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Akaheza kulaila mweidya intangulu ikigwe imigate kaguha mgate hewigwaduswe na mgate uhakigwe mavuta ya idya indolome na mgate udamanywe kwa unga uhakigwe mavuta na kuvika mlanga mwa mavuta ye ndolome na chiya ichiga cha kulume cha kunyuma. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Niyo amwinka Haluni na wanawe mwe mikono yawo, nawo niyo wavinula kulanga kulagisa kugamba wamlaviza Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Akaheza Musa aguha inkande iyo kulaila mwe mikono yawo na kuitikimya mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, hamwenga ne dilavyo dyo kutukimya, saviya lavyo dya kuwasenta kwa Zumbe. Dino ni lavyo dya nkande, dina mhempe wedi ukumuwagila Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Akaheza Musa aguha chiya ichifuwa na kuchinula kulanga saviya chilagiso cha kumlaviza Zumbe Chohile. Chihendo icho che indolome yo kusenta ni cha Musa, saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe.<verse eid="LEV 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Akaheza Musa niyo aguha mavuta yakukile na sakame kulaila mlanga mwe inchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko na kumnyunyiza Haluni na wanawe na mwe zisuche zawo. Mwe isila iyo kawasenta kwa chausa cha ndima ya ulavyantambiko kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Musa amgamba Haluni na wanawe, “Ambikani idya inyama kulongozi hajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile kulongozi kwa Zumbe, muidye aho hajihi no lwivi hamwenga na mgate kulaila mwe ntangulu ina malavyo ye ndima ya kusenta, saviya Zumbe alagize Haluni na wanawe waidye. <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Nyama hegu mgate wowose nausigale waungwa utikimye. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Msekufosa kuse ko uwa we Dihema Dikukile kwa chipindi chose cha mazuwa mfungate, kubula chipindi chenyu cho kusentwe kwa Zumbe chisile. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Zumbe kachilagiza chidamanye savino chidamanye dyelo, chani Chohile awalekeileni amasa yenyu. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Mwaungwa mwikale mo uwa we Dihema Dikukile chilo na msi kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate, mkadamanya mbuli ziya Zumbe awalagizeni. Hamnadamanye ivyo mwabanika. Vino nivyo Zumbe anilagize.” <verse eid="LEV 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Ivyo Haluni na wanawe wadamanya mbuli zose alagize Zumbe kujinkila kwa Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s">Haluni Alavya lavyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Zuwa dya mnane kujinka mazuwa mfungate ya kusentwa, Musa kamwitanga Haluni na wanawe hamwenga na vilongozi wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Niyo amgamba Haluni, “Guha njeku na ndolome heina lema mkamlavize Zumbe, njeku kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa ne ndolome kwa lavyo dya kutikimya. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Ukaheza wagambile Waizulaeli waguhe vulata kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kulombeza wivano na njeku ya mhilimo umwenga, na ndolome ya mhilimo umwenga hewana lema kwachausa cha lavyo dya kutikimya tiki, <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />na njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kulombeza utondowazi, wakamlavize Zumbe Chohile hamwenga na lavyo dya unga uhanganywe na mavuta. Kwaviya dyelo Zumbe nawalaile.”<verse eid="LEV 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Waizulaeli wegala vyose ivyo kulongozi kwe Dihema Dikukile chila chintu chiya Musa awalagize, na wantu wose wadugana aho na kumvikila Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Musa awagamba, “Zumbe kawalagizani nyuwe mdamanye vino chani muwone ung'azi wakwe.” <verse eid="LEV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />Akaheza Musa amgamba Haluni, “Hita ko wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, ukalavye lavyo dya kusa masa na lavyo dya kutikimya kwachausa cha kusa masa yako na masa ya wantu wose wa Izulaeli. Ulavye malavyo ya kusa masa ya wantu, saviya alagize Zumbe.”<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Ivyo Haluni kaita ko wani wo kulaviza ntambiko na kuchinja injeku idya ye dilavyo dyo kusa amasa yakwe mwenye. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Wanawe wamwigaila sakame wachingile mwe bakuli, na kutweza ididole dyakwe mwe isakame, nakuihaka mwa mahembe yose yo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, isakame isigale kaitila hasi hechitako cho wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Akaheza niyo atikimya amavuta yose ne zifigo mbili ne chihendo chedi che idini mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, saviya Zumbe Chohile amlagize Musa. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Mna umkota ne nyama kakuvitikimya kuse kwe nkambi.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Akaheza Haluni niyo achinja iyo indolome ye dilavyo dyakwe dyo kutikimya. Wanawe wamwigaila isakame, naye niyo aimyagila ntendele zose zo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Wamwinka umtwi ne vihande vituhu vyo mnyama uyo, naye niyo avitikimya mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Umo henati kutikimya ivintu ivyo, kasunta utumbo ne viga na kuvitikimya hamwenga na diya idilavyo dyo kutikimya mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Haluni eze aheze alavya lavyo kwa chausa cha wantu wose wa Izulaeli. Kaguha imbuzi ye dilavyo dya kusa masa, kaichinja na kulavya lavyo dya kusa masa, saviya adamanye kwa diya idilavyo dyakwe mwenye. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Akajika niyo egala mnyama ywa lavyo dya kutikimya. Niyo amchinja na kumlavya saviya Zumbe Chohile amlagize adamanye. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Akaheza niyo aguha chifumba cha unga na kuutikimya mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, hamwenga na malavyo ya kutikimya chila mtondo. <verse eid="LEV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Niyo achinja injeku ne indolome saviya lavyo dya kulonda utondowazi kwachausa cha wantu. Wanawe niyo wamwigaila isakame ichingigwe mwe bakuli naye niyo aimyagila mwe zimpembe zose zo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Mna Haluni niyo aguha mavuta ye njeku ne ndolome hamwenga nomchila we ndolome na mavuta yagubike utumbo nezifigo zose mbili ne chihendo chedi cheidini, <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />mna kaguha amavuta na kuyegala mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko na kuyatikimya tiki, akaheza enula kulanga viya ivifuwa vya wadya awanyama na kuvinula kulananga. <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />Akaheza Haluni niyo avinula kulanga kulagisa kugamba amlaviza Zumbe Chohile saviya Musa alagize.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Haluni eze abinde kulavya amalavyo yose yo kutikimya na kulombeza utondowazi, niyo awenuila wantu imkono yakwe na kuwajimbika, akaheza niyo asela. <verse eid="LEV 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Musa na Haluni niyo wengile mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile weze wafose wawajimbika wantu, wose wauwona ung'azi wa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Aho Zumbe kakoleza moto, na kutikimya, amavuta na vihande vye nyama vyendile mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. Wantu weze wawone ivyo, wose niyo watowa nchelejele na kwinamiza izinyuso zawo kubula hasi hesanga.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s">Masa ya Nadabu na Abihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Nadabu na Abihu wanawe dya Haluni, waguha chila yumwenga kazaye kakokela ubani waika moto na ubani, wamlaviza Zumbe moto ulemezwe mna haviligane na lagizo dya Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Kwa chipumpa Zumbe niyo awegaila moto, niyo wawakoma wadya wabwanga kulongozi kwakwe Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Akaheza Musa amgamba Haluni, “Vino nivyo Zumbe alongile hadya akagamba, ‘Wadya wose wakunisankanila waungwa wanitunye miye ni Mkuka, naho nanitunywe kulongozi kwa wantu wose.’ ” Mna Haluni niyo anyamala dwi.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Ivyo Musa niyo awetanga Mishaeli na Elisafani, wanawe dya Uzieli, mtumbawe dya Haluni, niyo awagamba, “Soni hano eze muse ivimba vya walukolo wenyu kulongozi kwe Dihema Dikukile kuse kwe nkambi.” <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Ivyo niyo weza kuvyusa ivimba na kuvigala kuse kwe nkambi kuno vikatenda nezisuche zawo zo ulavyantambiko, saviya Musa awalagize.<verse eid="LEV 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Akaheza Musa awagamba Haluni na wanawe watuhu, Eleazali na Itamali, Lekani kuchana izifili zenyu naho msekutatula izisuche zenyu kwa kulomboleza. Hegu sivyo, mwabanika na Zumbe nawehiwe wantu wose. Mna walukolo wenyu Waizulaeli wadaha kulomboleza kwachausa che file igalwe numoto ulaile kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Mse kufosa kuse ko lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile hegu sivyo mwabanika, kwaviya mavuta ya kuhaka ya Zumbe Chohile yemlanga mwenyu. Ivyo wadamanya saviya Musa alongile.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi kwa Walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Akaheza Zumbe amgambaga Haluni, <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Mkengila mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile weye na wanawo kulongozi kwangu mse kunywa divai hegu mpombe hegu sivyo, mwabanika. Ino ni Sigilizi ya mazuwa yose mo lweleko lwenyu lose. <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />Mwaungwa mpagule mbuli zikukile na mbuli hezikukile na mbuli za uzavu na mbuli sizo za uzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />Mwaungwa muwahinye wantu wose wa Izulaeli Sigilizi zose ziya niwenkileni kujinkila kwa Musa.”<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Musa kawagamba Haluni na wanawe wadya waidi wasigale, Eleazali na Itamali, “Guhani udya unga usigale we dilavyo akulavizwa Zumbe kwa moto, udamanyeni migate heigwaduswe muidye haguhi no wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, kwaviya idilavyo dino dikukisa. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Idyeni mwe hantu hakukile, kwaviya ni chihendo chako na wanawo cha lavyo dikulavigwa kwa Zumbe kwa moto. Ivyo nivyo Zumbe anilagize. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Mna ichifuwa ne chiga vikwinulwa kulanga kulagisa kugamba mwamlaviza Zumbe Chohile, mwadaha kuvidya hantu hazumilwe kwa kuvikila kulongozi kwa Zumbe. Naudye weye na wanawo wachilume na wachiche, vintu ivyo kwinkwa vitende vihendo vyenyu na welekwa wako kulaila mwe malavyo ya wantu wa Izulaeli kulombeza utondowazi kulaila kwa Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Nawegale chiya ichiga cha kunyuma ne chifuwa chipindi amavuta yakalavigwa saviya lavyo dya kutikimya, navinulwe kulanga kulagisa kugamba nivya Zumbe. Vihendo ivyo navitende vyako hamwenga na welekwa wako mazuwa yose, saviya Zumbe Chohile alagize.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Ivyo Musa kalondesa ilavigwa kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa niyo abunkula kugamba naitikimya kale. Niyo awafila maya vitendese Eleazali na Itamali wana wa Haluni wasigale, na kuwauza, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />“Nimbwani hamuidile imbuzi yo kusa amasa mwe hantu hakukile? Kwaviya chino ni chintu chikukise namwinkigwa iyo chani kusa malema ya wantu, chani Zumbe awalekeile amasa yawo. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Kwaviya isakame yakwe haigalwe mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile, namungwa muidile mndani mwe hantu hakukile, saviya nilagize.”<verse eid="LEV 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Haluni amhitula Musa, “Kaula wanangu dyelo walavya lavyo dyawo dya kusa masa na lavyo dya kutikimya kulongozi kwa Zumbe, nisavino mbuli zino zinilaila miye dyelo. Naho hegu nadile diya idilavyo dyo kusa amasa vino dyelo nadizumilwa kulongozi kwa Zumbe?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Musa eze eve ivyo, niyo awona ni vyedi.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s">Wanyama wakudaha kudigwa na hewekungwa kudigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />Chohile kawagamba Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />“Wagambileni wantu wa Izulaeli mwa wanyama wemwe isi, wano nawo wakudaha kudya, <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />mwadaha kudya wanyama wose wata ngaga zipangane ntendele mbili naho zaseula, <verse eid="LEV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />mna msekudya mnyama yoyose yudya akuseula mna izingaga zakwe hazipangane ntendele mbili, hegu yudya ngaga zakwe zipangana mna hakuseula. Msekudya ngamiya, kwaviya yaseula mna izingaga zakwe hazipangane ntendele mbili. Kwenyu uyo ni mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Mpelele msekudya, uyo aseula mna ngaga zakwe hazipangane, kwenyu uyo ni mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Msekudya buga idyo dyaseula mna ngaga zakwe hazipangane kwenyu idyo ni zavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Msekudya nguluwe zina ngaga zipangane mna hazikuseula, kwenyu izo ni zavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Msekudya awanyama awo hegu kukufya ivimba vyawo kwaviya ni wazavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile kwenyu.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />Samaki zose mwe bahali hegu mwe mito zina mapezi na magwalatu mwadaha kudya, <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />mna chumbe chochose chikwikala mwe bahali hegu mwe mito, chiya hechine mapezi hegu magwalatu msekuchidya kwaviya ni ihizo kwa Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Vyumbe ivvyo ni ihizo kwenyu, ni mwiko kuvidya hegu kukufya ivimba vyawo. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Msekujeza kudya chintu chochose chikwikala mwe mazi hechina mapezi hegu magwalatu ni ihizo kwenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />“Wadege wose wano wakutimila msekuwadya, gushu na mpungu na bizi, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />mwewe na kimpanga na weyawe wose, <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />kungulu na weyawe wose, <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />lubatavua na mgulo na makungwi yesimane, <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />makungwi madodo na msani na makungwi makulu, <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />mzinge na yangeyange na wanundu, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />nkolongo na wanundu na wanundu wose wesimile.”<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />“Wadudu wose wana mawawa na wakujenda kwa viga vine, awo ni wazavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile mwenyu, <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />mna wadudu awamwenga wata mawawa na wakujenda kwa viga vine vya kupilika mwe sanga mwadaha mdye. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Awo ni chila namna ya sije, chila senene, chila mpasi na chila mahalala. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Mna wadudu watuhu wose wana mawawa na viga vine ni ihizo kwenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />“Kukufya wanyama wesimile kwamtenda mntu atenda mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile, yoyose nakufye vimba vyawo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Mntu naguhe hantu mwe vimba vyakwe natende mzavu kubula chisingi, na suche zakwe zaungwa zifulwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />Mntu yoyose nakufye mnyama mta ngaga zipangane mna hakuseula, mntu uyo natende mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Wanyama wose wakujenda kwa vifumba vyawo hata hegu wana viga vine ni wazavu kwenyu, na yoyose nakufye chimba cha mnyama sauyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />Mntu yoyose nenule chimba natende mzavu kubula chisingi, uyo vyaungwa afule suche zakwe. Wanyama awo ni ihizo kwenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />“Vyumbe vikutimila ni vizavu kwenyu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile, mpuku na nkanu na chila gondo dyesimane, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />zumbulugutu na nchenje na magondo tandangovi na lwivi. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Awo wose ni wazavu kwenyu na yoyose nakufye ivimba vyawo, natende mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Uneva chimba che vyumbe ivyo chinagwela chintu chochose, chitende chintu cha mbawo hegu suche hegu mkota hegu juniya hegu chiya chochose chikujesezwa kwa ndima yoyose idya, chiya icho nachitende chizavu kubula chisingi. Chani kuchitenda chedi chaungwa chisuntwe kwa mazi. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Hegu chimba chakwe chinagwela chiya cha ulongo, ivyo, chintu chochose chimndani mwe nyungu iyo ni chizavu, inyungu iyo itulwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Hegu mazi kulaila mwe inyungu iyo yanetikila mwe nkande yoyose naitende ni zavu hegu mazi ayo yanetikila mwe chakunywa chochose nachite chizavu. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Chila chintu nachigwelwe ni hantu he vimba ivyo, nachitende chizavu. Uneva ni chintu cha kwanikila hegu ziko, vyaugwa vitulwe vihande hande. Navitende vizavu, navyo ni vizavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Hamwenga na ayo, chimba icho chinagwela mwe sima hegu sokwe ya mazi navitende ni vyedi. Mna mntu yoyose nachikufye ichimba icho natende mzavu. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Hegu hantu hohose he chimba icho chinagwela mwe mbeyu za kuhanda, mbeyu izo hazitende zavu. <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Mna uneva mbeyu zilwekwa chani zihote, chihendo chochose che chimba icho chinagwela mwe mbeyu izo zidulwe hale.”<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />“Uneva mnyama yoyose mkungigwa mdye, anafa mwenye, yoyose nakufye ichimba chakwe, natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Mntu yoyose nadye nyama ye chimba icho hegu kwinula ichimba icho, nafule suche zakwe, natende mzavu kubula chisingi.”<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />“Chumbe chochose chikutambala mwe isi ni chizavu kwenyu, msekujeza kuchidya. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Chumbe chochose chikubuluzika neinda yakwe hegu chochose chikujenda kwa viga vyakwe vine hegu viga vilozize, msekuchidya, kwaviya ni chizavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile kwenyu. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Ivyo, msekwetenda wazavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile kwa kudya vyumbe vikutambala na kwetenda wazavu. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Kwaviya miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu, kwesenteni na kutenda wakuka kwaviya miye ni mkuka. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Ni miye Zumbe niwalavizeni mwe isi ya Misili chani nitende Chohile ywenyu, ivyo, mtende wakuka kwaviya miye ni mkuka.”<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />“Elo, ino ni sigilizi ikulanga wanyama na wadege na vyumbe vyose vikwikala mwa mazi na mwe isi. <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />Kaulisani mo kupagula mgati mwe vyumbe vizavu na sivyo vizavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile, hechikungwa kudigwa na hechikugwa kudigwa.”<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s">Kuwakukiza wavyele wakaheza Kwefungula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />Chohile niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />wagambile wantu wa Izulaeli vino, “Mvyele anenula nda, nakwefugula mwana chilume, natende mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. Kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate saviya akutenda mzavu mwa mazuwa yo uvyele wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Umwana uyo najelwe ngasu mwe zuwa dyakwe dya mnane. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Akaheza nine dyo umwana uyo najendeleza kutenda mzavu kwa chipindi cha mazuwa milongo mitatu na ntatu. Mwe chipindi icho, asekujeza kukufya chochose chisentigwe hegu kwingila hantu hakuvikila kubula mazuwa yakwe yo kukukizwa nayachintile.”<verse eid="LEV 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />“Mna, uneva kefungula mwana chiche, ivyo, natende mzavu kwa chipindi cha majuma maidi saviya vili akatenda mwa mazuwa yakwe. Nagoje kwa mazuwa milongo mtandatu na mtandatu naho nakukizwe.”<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />“Mazuwa yo kukuka kwakwe yakaheza, vitende kefungula mwana chilume hegu ywa chiche, namwigaile mlavyantambiko hajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile ndolome ya mhilimo umwenga kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kutikimya na chinda dya kasuwamanga hegu suwa, kwachausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Mlavyantambiko namlavize kulongozi kwa Zumbe na kumdamanyiza mviko wa wivano kuongozi kwa Zumbe. Ivyo mvyele uyo natende kakuka kulawana ne sakame yakwe imlaile. Ayo ni malagizo mwe mvyele yoyose nadamanye akaheza kwefungula mwana chilume hegu ywa chiche.”<verse eid="LEV 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />“Uneva hakudaha kulavya ndolome, ivyo, negale suwa mbili hegu machinda maidi ya wasuwamanga, kamwenga kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kutikimya na katuhu kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kusizwa masa. Mlavyantambiko namtendele uyo mvyele mviko wa wivano, naye natende kakuka.”<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe manyonje ya nkanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />Zumbe kawagambila Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />“Uneva mntu yoyose anatenda na kahele hegu kibandulo mo mwili wakwe, inabunkuka kugamba ni matana, ivyo, egalwe kwa mlavyantambiko Haluni hegu yumwenga ywa wanawe eli mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Mlavyantambiko nahakaule ahantu aho hana unyonje, uneva amalaika ya hantu aho yahitukila kutenda yang'aile na unyonje wenye unabunkuka kugamba wikundani kujinka inkanda yo mwili wakwe, ayo ni matana. Mlavyantambiko anaheza kumkaula, nagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Mna uneva ichibandulo ching'ala mna hakengile kundani kwe nkanda na amalaika ya ahantu aho hayahitukile kutenda yang'aile, ivyo, mlavyantambiko namsente mntu uyo kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Zuwa dya mfungate, mlavyantambiko namkaule vituhu umntu uyo, uneva, kuligana nokukaula kwa mlavyantambiko, unyonje uwo haunati kuvavagala mwe nkanda yakwe, ivyo, mlavyantambiko namsente umntu uyo kwa mazuwa matuhu mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Mlavyantambiko namkaule umntu uyo zuwa dya mfungate. Uneva kuligana no kukaula kwakwe, idya intendele yo unyonje ifwila na unyonje hauvavagale, ivyo, mlavyantambiko nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni ywedi, icho chendaga ni chibandulo du. Mntu uyo nafule izisuche zakwe, naye natende suyo mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Mna ichibandulo icho chinavavagala mwe nkanda, akaheza kukaulwa ni mlavyantambiko kugamba suyo mzavu mntu uyo kwelagisa kwa mlavyantambiko kwa chausa cha kukukizwa kwakwe, ivyo, neze vituhu kwa mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Mlavyantambiko namkaule vituhu, uneva chiya ichibandulo chivavagala mwe nkanda, ivyo, mlavyantambiko nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni mzavu, ayo ni matana.”<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />“Uneva mntu katozwa ni unyonje wa nkanda ukuvavagala, negalwe kwa mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Mlavyantambiko namkaule, uneva kuna uvifi ung'aile utendile amalaika yakwe yang'aile na uvifi uwo uhituka kutenda nkwenje mbisi, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />ayo ni matana ya chipindi chitali. Mlavyantamiko nagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. Hampagule vituhu uyo mntu kwa kumkaula kwaviya ni mzavu kale.”<verse eid="LEV 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />“Uneva amatana yatoza naho yavavagala umwili wose, kulaila komtwi kubula kwe zinyayo saviya nawone mlavyantambiko, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />aho mlavyantambiko namkaulise. Mlavyantambiko anawona matana yavavagala mo mwili wose, ivyo, nawagambile wantu kugamba suyo mzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile kwaviya mwili wakwe uhituka kutenda ung'ala kulagisa kugamba unyonje wahona, ivyo mntu uyo ni ywedi. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Mna kunawoneka nkwenje mbisi mo mwili wo mntu uyo, ivyo, mntu uyo hakuzumilika kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Mlavyantambiko nakaule iyo inkwenje imbisi na kuwagambila wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile kwaviya ayo ni matana. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Mna iyo inkwenje inahitukila vituhu kutenda ing'ala, mntu uyo nauye kwa mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Mlavyantambiko namkaule, anawona kugamba ihitukila kutenda ing'ala, ivyo, nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni ywedi.”<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />“Uneva mntu katozwa ni ihu, mna dihona, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />mna hantu hadya hendile ne idihu hahituka kutenda chivimbe ching'aile hegu henkundu na ung'azi hadodo vyaungwa amlagise mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Mlavyantambiko namkaule uyo mntu. Mlavyantambiko anawona hahituka kutenda na chivimbe na amalaika ya hantu aho yahituka kutenda yang'ala, ivyo, mlavyantambiko nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni mzavu, uwo nunyonje wa matana ulawane na ihu. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Mna uneva mlavyantambiko anamkaula uyo mntu na kuwona kugamba malaika ya aho ahantu hayang'aile naho hahana bome, mna hafufumala, ivyo, nampagule uyo mntu kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Uneva mwe chipindi icho unyonje uwo unavavagala mwe nkanda, akaheza aho, mlavyantambiko nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni mzavu, hantu aho hana unyonje. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Mna, uneva hadya ahantu hahavavagale, ivyo, idya ni nkovu ya ihu du. Mlavyantambiko nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni ywedi.”<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />“Uneva, hana hantu hahyele na idya inyama mbisi ihitukila kutenda unkundu na ung'azi hegu ing'ala, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />mlavyantambiko nahakaule. Uneva anawona kugamba malaika yahituka kutenda yang'ala naho hana chivimbe, ayo ni matana. Matana ayo yelaviza kwa sila ya hantu aho hahyele. Mlavyantambiko nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni mzavu, kwaviya ana unyonje wa matana <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Mna uneva mlavyantambiko anawona kugamba amalaika ya ahantu aho hayang'aile naho hahana chivimbe mna hafufumala, ivyo, mlavyantambiko nampagule uyo mntu kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Zuwa dya mfungate mlavyantambiko namkaule. Uneva uvavagala mwe nkanda, ivyo, mlavyantambiko nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni mzavu, kwaviya ana unyonje wa matana. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Mna, uneva ichivimbe haivavagale, mna ifufumala, icho ni chivimbe chilawane na kuhya, ivyo, mlavyantambiko nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni ywedi, kwaviya iyo ni nkovu ya kuhya.”<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />“Uneva mntu yoyose mgosi hegu mvyele, ana nkwenje mo mtwi hegu mwe chilevu, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />mlavyantambiko naukaule unyonje uwo. Uneva anawona kugamba hana chivimbe na fili za ahantu aho zinjano naho sisisili, ivyo, nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni mzavu, kwaviya uwo ni uhele naho ni matana ya mtwi hegu ya chilevu. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Uneva mlavyantambiko anawona kugamba hana chivimbe naho izifili sizo ntitu, ivyo mlavyantambiko nampagule uyo mntu kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Zuwa dya mfungate mlavyantambiko nakaule idya inkwenje. Uneva haivavagale naho hahana malaika yenjano hegu uhele wowose ahantu aho, ivyo, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />mntu uyo nawegule fili hegu ndevu zakwe. Mna hantu hadya hano uhele hahawegule. Akaheza mlavyantambiko nampagule uyo mntu kwa mazuwa mfungate matuhu. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Zuwa dya mfungate, mlavyantambiko nakaule udya uhele. Uneva anawona kugamba uhele uwo hauvavagale mwe nkanda naho hawingile kundani kwe nkanda, ivyo, nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uho ni ywedi. Mntu uyo nafule izisuche zakwe, naye natende ywedi mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Mna uneva uhele uwo uvavagala eze aheze kulongwa kugamba ni ywedi, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />mntu uyo nakaulwe ni mlavyantambiko vituhu, uneva uhele uvavagala mwe nkanda, mlavyantambiko haunge kulonda fili zinjano, mntu uyo natende mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Mna uneva mlavyantambiko anawona kugamba udya uhele uhona naho ahantu aho hahota fili ntitu, ivyo, nkwenje izo zihona, mntu uyo ni ywedi. Mlavyantambiko nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni ywedi.”<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />“Uneva mntu yoyose, atende mgosi hegu mvyele, ana hantu hang'aile mo mwili wakwe, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />mlavyantambiko namkaule uyo mntu. Uneva mlavyantambiko anawona kugamba hantu aho hang'ala hadodo, uwo ni uhele du, mntu uyo ni ywedi.”<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />“Uneva mgosi ana luhala, uyo ni ywedi kwaviya ana luhala du. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Uneva luhala ulo lulawa kunyuma kubula kulongozi mntu uyo ana luhala du mna ni ywedi. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Mna uneva hantu aho, momtwi mo luhala hegu mwe chinengo ho luhala hana hantu unkundu na ung'azi, ayo ni matana yakulaila moluhala lwakwe mo mtwi hegu mwe chinengo chakwe. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Mlavyantambiko namkaule. Uneva mlavyantambiko anawona kugamba icho chivimbe china unkundu na ung'azi mo luhala hegu mwe chinengo chakwe naho wawoneka saviya matana mwe nkanda yakwe, <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />ivyo, mntu uyo ana matana, uyo ni mzavu. Mlavyantambiko nawagambile wantu kugamba mntu uyo ni mzavu. Unyonje wi komtwi wakwe.”<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />“Mta matana yoyose navike suche zitatuke, fili zakwe hazichanwe, nagubike mlomo wakwe wa kulanga naho nagute akagamba, ‘Miye ni mzavu, miye ni mzavu.’ <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Najendeleze kutenda mzavu kwa chipindi chose ana uwo unyonje, uyo ni mzavu, uyo nekale ichedu kuse kwe nkambi.”<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ya kuhu mwe suche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />“Uneva kuna kuhu dikulagisa unyonje mwe suche, itende ilukwa kwa mazoya ya ngoto hegu isumwa kwa chitamabala chedi ching'aile, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />suche iyo itende isumwa hegu ilukwa kwa chitambala chedi ching'aile hegu kwa mazoya ya ngoto hegu ni suche ya nchingo yoyose idya, <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />hegu idikuhu idyo dyalagisa langi ikijani hegu inkundu mwe iyo isuche, ivyo, suche iyo ina kuhu. Ivyo vyaungwa kumlagisa mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Mlavyantambiko nakaule idikuhu idyo dye chilagiso icho na kuika isuche iyo kunkanda kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Zuwa dya mfungate nakaule idikuhu idyo, uneva divavagala mwe suche iyo, itende ni ya kusumwa hegu ya kuluka hegu niya nchingo hegu niya nchingo yoyose idya, suche iyo ina kuhu. Ivyo suche iyo ni zavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Mlavyantambiko nayoke isuche iyo kwaviya ina kuhu dikubalanga suche.”<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />“Uneva mlavyantambiko anawona kugamba kuhu idyo hadivavagale mwe suche, ivyo, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />nasigile suche iyo ifulwe na kwikwa kunkanda kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Mlavyantambiko naikaule vituhu isuche iyo ikaheza kufulwa. Uneva hadya hantu hahahitukile ilangi yakwe hata vikatenda kuhu idyo hadivavagale, ivyo, suche iyo ni zavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. Suche iyo nauyoke moto, itende chilagiso cha idikuhu idyo dikunyuma hegu dikulongozi kwe suche iyo.” <verse eid="LEV 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />“Uneva mlavyantambiko nawone kugamba diya idikuhu difufumala ize ifulwe, ivyo natatule idya intendele ine idikuhu. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Uneva idikuhu idyo dyawoneka vituhu mwe suche isumigwe hegu ilukigwe hegu mwe chintu chochose cha nchingo, ivyo kuhu divavagala. Aho suche iyo na uyoke moto. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Mna hegu idikuhu dyusika suche ize ifulwe yaungwa ifulwe nkanana ya kaidi chani itende yedi mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile.”<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Iyo ni sigilizi ikungwa mwe kuhu dikulaila mwe suche idamanywe kwa mazoya ya ngoto hegu chitambala chedi ching'aile hegu isumigwe hegu ilukigwe hegu ya nchingo. Kwa sila iyo namdahe kubunkula mgati mwe suche siyo zavu na zavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s">Kukukizwa ukaheza kuhona unyonje wa nkanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />“Ino niyo isigilizi ya unyonje wa nkanda, mwe zuwa dya kukukizwa kwakwe, negalwe kwa mlavyantambiko, <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />mlavyantambiko nalawe kuse kwe nkambi, nakaule uneva mta matana uyo kahona, <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />ivyo, mlavyantambiko nalagize wantu wegale wadege waidi wemeso wakuzumilwa mwe malavyo na chipande cha mhelezi na nyuzi zinkundu na tambi dya mti ukwitangwa hisopo kwa uyo mntu akungwa akukizwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Mlavantambiko nawalagize wachinje kadege kamwenga mwe nyungu ina mazi yedi ya sokwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Akaheza mlavyantambiko naguhe kadya akadege kemeso na chihande cho mti wo mhelezi na nyuzi inkundu na diya iditambi dyo mti we hisopo na kuvijela vyose mwe sakame ya kadya akadege kachinjigwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Akaheza, nammyagile uyo mta kukukizwa chihendo che sakame nkanana mfungate, akaheza namlongele mntu uyo kugamba ni ywedi. Kadya akadege kemeso nakalekele kaite zakwe kwe zinkonde kuse ko mzi.” <verse eid="LEV 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />Uyo mntu nafule izisuche zakwe na kuwegule izifili zakwe, na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende kakuka. Yakaheza ayo nauye kwe nkambi, mna nekale kuse kwe dihema dyakwe kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Zuwa dya mfungate nawegule vituhu izifili zakwe zose nezindevu nezinkumbitu, ukajika nafule izisuche zakwe na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende kakuka. <verse eid="LEV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />Zuwa dya mnane negale ndolome mbili zedi, hezine lema na ngoto fyele yedi ya mhilimo umwenga na chilo ntatu za unga usungigwe vyedi uhanganywe na mavuta kwa lavyo dya unga hamwenga na mavuta lobo ntatu. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Mlavyantambiko akunga amkukize uyo umntu namwigale kulongozi kwa Zumbe hajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile hamwenga ne vintu egale. <verse eid="LEV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />Mlavyantambiko naguhe ndolome imwenga na kumlaviza lavyo dya kusa masa hamwenga na yadya mavuta na kuvinula kulanga kulagisa kugamba amlaviza Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Akaheza nachinje idya indolome mwe hantu hakukile, wakuchinjizwa wanyama wa lavyo dya kusa masa na lavyo dya kutikimya. Lavyo dino dya kusa mlema, saviya dili lavyo dya kusa masa nivya mlavyantambiko, ni lavyo dikukise. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Mlavyantambiko naguhe chihendo cha sakame ye dilavyo idyo dyo kusa malema na kumhaka uyo mntu akukukizwa mwe mpembe ye digutwi dyakwe dya kulume ne didole kulu dyo mkono wa kulume ne didole kulu dye chiga chakwe cha kulume. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Akaheza, mlavyantambiko naguhe mavuta majeche kulaila mwe chikombe na kuyajela mwe chifumba cho mkono wakwe wa kumoso. <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />Natweze ididole dyakwe dyo mkono wa kulume mwa mavuta ayo na kummyagila mavuta majeche uyo mntu akukukizwa nkanana mfungate kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Mavuta nayasigale mwe chifumba chakwe namhake uyo mntu akukukizwa mwe mpembe ye digutwi dyakwe dya kulume ne didole kulu dyo mkono wakwe wa kulume ne didole kulu dye chiga chakwe cha kulume, hantu ahadya amhakile isakame ye dilavyo dyo kusa malema. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Yadya mavuta yasigale namhake mo mtwi uyo mntu akukukizwa. Ivyo mlavyantambiko namdamanyize mviko wa wivano kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />“Mlavyantambiko nalavye lavyo kwachausa cha kusa malema na kumtendela mviko wa wivano chani kumusiza uzavu wakwe mntu uyo akukukizwa chani kumusiza masa yakwe. Akaheza nachinje ndolome ya lavyo dya kutikimya. <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />Mlavyantambko nalavye diya idilavyo dyo kutikimya na lavyo dya unga mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko. Ivyo mlavyantambiko namtendele uyo mntu mviko wa wivano, uyo natende ywedi mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile.”<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />“Mna uneva mntu uyo ni mchiwa, hakudaha kulavya ivintu ivyo, negale ndolome itende lavyo dya maliho hantu hamalavyo ya kusa malema. Iyo nainulwe kulanga itende lavyo kwaviya hana ivyo ivintu nakongigwa alavya. Iviya nagale chilo imwenga ya unga usungigwe vyedi uhanganywe na mavuta lobo ntatu ya mzaituni. <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />Naho negale wasuwamanga waidi hegu machinda maidi ya wasuwamanga saivyo nadahe, kamwenga na katende kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa na katuhu kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kutikimya.”<verse eid="LEV 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />“Zuwa dya mnane namwigaile mlavyantambiko vintu ivyo kulongozi ko lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile kwachausa cha kukukizwa kwakwe kulongozi kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Mlavyantambiko naguhe ndolome ye dilavyo dyo kusa malema hamwenga na yadya mavuta chikombe chimwenga na kuvinula kulanga kulagisa kugamba amlaviza Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Nachinje iyo indolome ye dilavyo dyo kusa malema, naguhe sakame njeche na kumhaka uyo mntu akukukizwa mwe mpembe ye digutwi dyakwe dya kulume na mwedidole kulu dyo mkono wakwe wa kulume na dole kulu dye chiga chakwe cha kulume. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Mlavyantambiko najele mavuta majeche mwe chifumba cho mkono wakwe wa kumoso. <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />Akaheza nammyagile uyo mntu kwa dole dyakwe dya kulume yadya mavuta yemwe chifumba chakwe cha kumoso nkanana mfungate kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Mlavyantambiko namhake mavuta mwe mpembe ye digutwi dyakwe dya kulume uyo mntu akukukizwa na mwedidole dyo mkono wakwe wa kulume na mwedidole kulu dye chiga cha kulume. Namhake hantu ahadya amhakile idya isakame ye dilavyo dyo kusa amalema. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Mavuta yasigale mwe chifumba chakwe namhake mo mtwi uyo mntu, chani amtendele mviko wa wivano kulongozi kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Akaheza mlavyantambiko naguhe suwa imwenga hegu kasuwamanga kamwenga mwa wadya waidi kuligana neivyo negale uyo mntu. <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />Suwa naitende kwachausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa na katuhu kwachausa cha lavyo dya kutikimya. Hamwenga na awo, nalavye lavyo dya unga, uyo mlavyantambiko namdamanyize mviko wa wivano uyo mntu akukukizwa kulongozi kwa Chohile.” <verse eid="LEV 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Ivyo nivyo vikungwa mwe malavyo ya mazwela kwa mntu mta matana hekudaha kulavya malavyo yakungwa mwe kumkukiza mntu.<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhu mwe zinyumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />Zumbe niyo alonga na Musa na Haluni, nakuwagamba, <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />Aho na mwingile mwe isi ya Kanani idya huwenkani itende yenyu, nakutende na chipindi nanidamanye makuhu yahote mwe viwambaza vya nyumba siku mwe isi namlisi. <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />Ivyo mta inyumba iyo augwa amgambile mlavyantambiko icho chikale enga kuhu chiwoneke mwe nyumba iyo. <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Mlavyantambiko nalagize vintu vyose mwe nyumba iyo vilavigwe kuse mwenye henati kukonga kuzuza idikuhu idyo, vinase kulongwa vyose kugamba ni vizavu mwe sila ya kumvikila chohile. Akaheza mlavyantambiko nengile kuikaula iyo inyumba. <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />Nazuzise idikuhu idyo, uneva kuhu idyo diwoneka mwe chiwambaza, naho dina langi ikijani hegu inkundu na kufifinya mwe chiwamabaza, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />ivyo, mlavyantambiko nafose kuse na kuivugala imilango ye nyumba iyo kwamazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Mwedizuwa dya mfungate mlavyantambiko nauye naho nakwingila mwenyumba iyo. Uneva idikuhu idyo divavagala mwe viwambaza vye nyumba iyo, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />mlavyantambiko nalagize mayuwe yemwe ntendele zina amakuhu zuswe na kudulwa kuse hantu hakudulwa vintu vizavu mwe sila ya kumvikila chohile. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Kusilibwa mndani mwenyumba iyo nakukwangulwe, msanga wakwe naudulwe hantu hazavu kuse ko mzi. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Akaheza nawaguhe mayuwe matuhu na kuzenga uhya ahantu wausize, awo nawaisilibe inyumba iyo vituhu. <verse eid="LEV 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />“Uneva idikuhu idyo dinalaila vituhu wakaheza kusa amayuwe ayo na kukwangula hadya hasilibwe na kusiliba uhya, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />naho mlavyantambiko nengile mndani na kuizuza. Uneva idikuhu divavagala na kubalanga ichiwambaza che nyumba iyo, idyo ni kuhu dikubalanga, nyumba iyo ni zavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Nyumba iyo, naibogozolwe na mayuwe yakwe nemiti yakwe na kusilibwa kwakwe vigalwe hantu hazavu kuse ko mzi. <verse eid="LEV 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />Naho mntu nengile mndani mwe nyumba iyo chipindi ivugalwe, natende mzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Yoyose akugona mwe nyumba iyo hegu kudila nkande mndani mwakwe, vyaungwa afule suche zakwe.”<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />“Mna uneva mlavyantambiko aneza kuizuza inyumba iyo, nakuwona kugamba idikuhu idyo hadivavagale ize isilibwe, ivyo, mlavyantambiko nalonge kugamba nyumba iyo ni yedi kwaviya idikuhu idyo disila. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Chani kuikukiza inyumba iyo, mwenye inyumba negale wadege waidi hamwenga na chihande cha mti wa mwelezi na nyuzi inkundu ya mazoya ya ngoto na tambi dya mti ukwitagwa hisopo. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Mlavyantambiko nachinje kadege kamwenga mwe nyungu ina mazi yedi yalaile mwe sokwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Naguhe chihande cho mti wo mwelezi ne ditambi dyo mti we hisopo na udya uzi wa mazoya ye ngoto winkundu hamwenga na kadya kadege akatuhu kemeso na kuvijela vyose mwe sakame ya kadya kadege kachinjigwe. Akaheza namyage isakame mlanga mwe inyumba iyo nkanana mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Ivyo nivyo nakukize inyumba iyo kwa sakame ya kadege na mazi yedi ya sokwe na kadege kemeso na chihande cha mti wa mwelezi na tambi dya mti ukwitangwa hisopo na mazoya ya ngoto yenkundu. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Kadya kadege kemeso nakalekele kaite kwe zinkonde kuse ko mzi. Ivyo nivyo naikukizwe inyumba iyo, nayo naitende yedi.”<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />“Yano nayo malagizo mwe namna yoyose ya manyonje ya kuvavagala mwe nkanda na kuhu dikubalanga nyumba, <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />kuhu dikuvavagala mwe suche hegu mwe nyumba, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />chibandulo ching'aile hegu chinkundu, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />Yano nayo malagizo ya kuhu hegu uhele wa matana chani kulagisa ni chintu chani chizavu na sicho chizavu mwe sila yo kumvikila chohile.”<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s">Umazimazi ukumlawa mntu ukumtenda asekuzumilwa kumvikila Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />Zumbe niyo alonga na Musa na Haluni, awagamba, <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />Wagambile Waizulaeli vino. Mgosi yoyose analawa ufila molusi lwakwe, ufila uwo wamtenda mzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Malagizo yakulanga uzavu uwo ni yano. Chipindi chose akulawawigwa nufila hegu wi mndani mwakwe, mntu uyo ni mzavu. <verse eid="LEV 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />Lusazi lolose nagonele hegu nekaile, nalutende ni luzavu. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Mntu yoyose na ludonte lusazi lwakwe mntu uyo aungwa afule izisuche zakwe, na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende mzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Mntu yoyose nekaile chintu chochose ekaile uyo mntu mta kulawigwa nufila, aungwa azifule izisuche zakwe na kuhaka mazi, natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />Mntu yoyose namkufye mntu akulawigwa nufila, aungwa afule suche zakwe na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />Mntu yoyose anamtwelwa mate mntu ywedi mntu uyo atwelwe amate aungwa afule izisuche zakwe, na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />Chilago chochose nekaile mntu akulawigwa nufila, akweile mwe mpunda hegu falasi chilago icho nachitende chizavu. <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Mntu yoyose nadonte chilago chochose ekaile mntu uyo, natende mzavu kubula chisingi. Mntu yoyose nenule chilago chochose chendile cho mntu uyo aungwa afule izisuche zakwe, na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />Mntu yoyose akulawigwa nufila anamdonta mntu henati kusunta imikono yakwe na kuhaka uyo adontigwe, natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />Chiya chochose cha ulongo chidontigwe ni mntu akualawigwa nufila chaungwa chitulwe. Mna chiya chochose cha lubawo chaungwa chisuntwe kwa mazi.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />Mntu yoyose anahona unyonje wakwe, aungwa agoje kwa mazuwa mfungate. Akaheza aungwa afule na kuhaka mazi ya momto, uyo natende ywedi. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Zuwa dya mnane, aungwa egale suwa mbili hegu machinda maidi ya wasuwamanga kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile hajihi nolwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile na kumwinka mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Mlavyantambiko na walavye awo, kamwenga kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa na akatuhu kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kutikimya, mlavyantambiko namtendele uyo mntu mviko wa wivano kulongozi kwa Zumbe na kumusiza uzavu wakwe wo kulawigwa nufila.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />Uneva mgosi yoyose akalawigwa ni mbeyu za chigosi, aungwa ahake mazi mwili mjima, uyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Suche yoyose itwekelwe ni mbeyu za chigosi hegu suche idamanywe kwa nchingo yoyose itwekelwe ni zimbeyu izo, vyaungwa zifulwe kwa mazi, izo nazitende zavu kubula chisingi.<verse eid="LEV 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Mgosi anagona na mvyele, wose waidi waungwa wahake mazi, nawo nawatende wazavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />Mvyele yoyose akatenda mwa mazuwa yakwe, hakuzumilwa kumvikila Chohile natende mzavu kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate. Umo akatenda mwa mazuwa ayo mntu yoyose namdonte umvyele uyo natende mzavu mwe sila ya kumvkila Chohile kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />Chintu chochose nagonele umo emwamazuwa yakwe nachitende chizavu, na chintu chochose nekaile nachitende chizavu. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Mntu yoyose nadonte lusazi lwa uyo mvyele aungwa afule suche zakwe na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Mntu yoyose nadonte chintu chochose ekaile uyo mvyele aungwa afule izisuche zakwe na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Mntu yoyose nadonte chintu chochose agonele hegu ekaile uyo mvyele, aungwa afula na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />Uneva mgosi anagona na mvyele emwamazuwa yakwe, sakame yo umvyele uyo inamtwekela uyo mgosi, mgosi uyo natende mzavu kwa mazuwa mfungate. Lusazi lolose nagonele uyo mgosi nalutende luzavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />Uneva mvyele alawigwa ni sakame kwa chipindi cha mazuwa yalozize kujinka ivyo vili mwa mazuwa yakwe, hegu alawigwa ni sakame mwe chipindi sicho chakwe. Ivyo, najendeleze kutenda mzavu chipindi chose saviya vili akatenda mwechipindi cha mazuwa yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Lusazi lolose akugonela chipindi icho hegu fumbi dyodyose akwikaila, navitende vizavu saviya vikwinga chipindi cha uzavu wakwe mo kulawigwa ni sakame. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Mntu yoyose nadonte vintu ivyo, natende mzavu, aungwa afule izisuche zakwe na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. <verse eid="LEV 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />Anaheza kunyala isakame yakwe mvyele uyo nagoje kwa mazuwa mfungate chani akuke, chipindi icho kinajinka nawagile kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Zuwa dya mnane naguhe suwa mbili hegu machinda maidi ya wasuwamanga na kumwigaila mlavyantambiko hajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Mlavyanambiko nalavye imwenga kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa na intuhu kwachausa cha lavyo dya kutikimya. Kwa kudamanya ivyo amtendela mviko wa wivano uyo mvyele kulongozi kwa Zumbe.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />“Ivyo nivyo namuwafunde wana wa Waizulaeli wanasekwingila mwe uzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile, kwakudamanya ivyo nawaditende Idihema Dikukile dihagati hawo kutenda zavu, nawo wanatenda ivyo nawabanike. <verse eid="LEV 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />Ayo nayo malagizo ya mgosi akulawigwa nufila na akulawigwa ni mbeyu za chigosi na kutenda mzavu, <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />na mvyele yoyose emwe chipindi cha mazuwa yakwe, na mgosi yoyose agonile na mvyele emwa mazuwa yakwe.”<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s">Zuwa dya kulekeilwa masa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />Wana waidi wa Haluni weze wabanike umo wamsogeilaga Zumbe na kumlaviza ubani hewikuwagila, Zumbe niyo alonga na Musa, <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" />“Longa na mlukolo ywako Haluni, kugamba asekwingila Hantu Hakukise kunyuma kwe dipaziya chipindi hechikuwagila. Asekwingila ahantu aho kwaviya naho nanilaile mwe ingu mlanga mwe ngubiko ye Dishanduku dye Dilagano hakwitangwa Hantu Hambazi. Hegu sivyo nabanike. <verse eid="LEV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />Umo Haluni henati kwingila Hantu Hakukise aungwa alavye lavyo dya njeku kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa, na ndolome kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kutikimya.” <verse eid="LEV 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />Umo henati kwingila nahake mazi mo mwili wose, akajika navale suche zikukile. Nengile hantu aho akatenda kavala putula na shati ntali isumigwe kwa chitamabala ching'aile na kwenyinya msipi wa chitambala chinga'ile na chilemba.<verse eid="LEV 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Kulaila mwa Waizulaeli naguhe mavulata maidi kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa na ndolome imwenga kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kutikimya. <verse eid="LEV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />Nkongo Haluni nalavye iyo injeku lavyo dya kusa masa kwa chausa chakwe mwenye na kutenda mviko wa wivano kwachausa chakwe mwenye na wanawe. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Akaheza, yadya amavulata amaidi nayaike hajihi no lwivi Dihema Dikukile kulongozi kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Haluni nayatoile tegatega ayo amavulata, dimwenga kwachausa cha Zumbe, na dya kaidi kwachausa vulata dikigalwa kuse kwenkambi kwe jini dikwitangwa Azazeli, dikatenda dinula masa ya wantu. <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Haluni negale idivulata digwelwe ni tegatega kwa chausa cha Zumbe, na kudilavya kwachausa cha kusa masa. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Mna diya idivulata digwelwe ni tegatega dya kaidi nadyuswe kulongozi kwa Zumbe dikatenda dimeso, kutenda mviko wa wivano. Mlavyantambiko nadilekele dite kwedijangwa kwa Azazeli dikatenda dinula masa ya wantu.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />Haluni negale njeku ya lavyo dya kusa masa kwachausa chakwe mwenye chani atende mviko wa wivano wakwe mwenye ne kaya yakwe. Akaheza nachinje injeku iyo kwachausa cha kusa masa. <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />Akaheza naguhe kazaye kakokela ubani kamemile makala ya moto kulaila mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko kulongozi kwa Zumbe na vifumba vidi vya ubani usagigwe vyedi vitendese, mwemikono yakwe, nakuwigala Hantu Hakukukise. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Negale udya ubani kulongozi kwa Zumbe na kuujela mwe moto, umosi wa udya ubani ugubike ngubiko yedi Shanduku dye Dilagano chani anasekubanika. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Naguhe sakame njeche ya idya injeku na kuinyunyiza kwa dole dyakwe ntendele ya mlanga mwe ngubiko ye Dishanduku akaheza nainyunyize nkanana mfungate na nkanana mfunkate kulongozi kwakwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />Akaheza nachinje diya idivulata dye dilavyo dya kusa masa kwa chausa cha wantu wose. Sakame yedivulata idyo naigale mndani mwe Hantu Hakukise na kudamanya saviya adamanye naidya isakame ye injeku, nainyunyize mlanga mwe ngubiko ye Dishanduku dye Dilagano na kulongozi kwakwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />Kwakutenda ivyo nahakukize Hantu Hakukise kwachausa cha masa yose ya Waizulaeli. Nivyo natende naho kwachausa che Dihema Dikukile dimgati mwa wantu awo wata uzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Umo Haluni akengila Hantu Hakukise kudamanya umviko wo wivano kwachausa chakwe mwenye na wantu wemwe kaya yakwe na wantu wose wa Izulaeli, kusekutendeka ng'o na mntu yoyose mwe Dihema Dikukile kubula umo akaheza kudamanya mviko wo wivano kwachausa cha walukolo wakwe na kwachausa cha wantu wose wa Izulaeli na kufosa kuse. <verse eid="LEV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Akaheza nalawe kwita ko wani wo kulaviza ntambiko ikulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile na kwekukiza, akaheza naguhe sakame njeche ya idya injeku, na sakame ya diya idivulata, na kuijela mlanga mwa chila mpembe yo wani. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Nainyunyize umo mo wani sakame kwa dole dyakwe nkanana mfungate, na kuisenta kwachausa cha Chohile na kuikukiza chani uzavu wose uwafose wana wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuzi ikwigalwa kuse kwe nkambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />Umo Haluni akaheza kuhakukiza Hantu Hakukise, ne Dihema Dikukile no wani, naho nadigale diya idivulata dimeso dikwigalwa kuse kwe nkambi kuno dikatenda dinula amasa ya wantu. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Haluni naike imikono yakwe mlanga mo mtwi wa idyo idivulata dimeso, na kweila mlanga mwakwe masa yose ya wana wa Izulaeli, na wavu wawo wose wa kumlemela Chohile. Kwakudamanya ivyo natende asamiza masa ya wantu wa Izulaeli na kuyaika mlanga mwa idyo idivulata. Akaheza nadisake idyo idivulata dite kwedijangwa, nasagule mntu na kumwinka adisakile kwedijangwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Nadisake diya idivulata dite kwedijangwa kuntu hekwine wantu dikatenda dinula masa yawo yose. <verse eid="LEV 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />Akaheza Haluni nengile mwe Dihema Dikukile, nahambule izisuche zakwe izo availe hadya akengila Hantu Hakukise na kuzasa mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />Naite hantu hakukile na kuhaka mazi mo mwili na kuvala izisuche zakwe. Nafose na kulavya lavyo dyakwe mwenye dya kutikimya, na lavyo dya kutikimya dya wantu wa Izulaeli, kwa kudamanya mviko wa wivano kwachausa chakwe na kwa chausa cha wantu wose. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Iviya aungwa atikimye mlanga mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko, mavuta yo mnyama we idilavyo dyo kusa masa.<verse eid="LEV 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />Yudya mntu egale idivulata dinule amasa ya wantu aungwa afule suche zakwe na kuhaka mazi mo mwili wakwe, naho nadahe kwingila kwe nkambi. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />Idya injeku na diya idivulata vilavigwe lavyo kwachausa cha kusa masa, sakame yawo naigalwe Hantu Hakukise kwachausa cha kudamanyiza mviko wa wivano, nazigalwe kuse kwe nkambi na kutikimya. Mikota yawo na nyama zawo na mavi vyose na vitikimye. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Yudya mntu navitikimye nafule izisuche zakwe na kuhaka mazi naho nadahe kwingila kwe nkambi. <verse eid="LEV 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />Dino ni lagizo dikungwa mditoze mazuwa yose. Mwezuwa dya mlongo mo mwezi wa mfungate, mongigwa mfunge, msekudamanya ndima yoyose, mkaya na mjeni emwe isi yenyu. <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />Namdamanye ivyo kwaviya zuwa idyo namdamanyizwe mviko wa wivano msuntwe masa yenyu, nanywi namtende wedi kulongozi kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Zuwa idyo ni zuwa dya kuhumulisa nanywi namfunge. Lagizo dino ni dwa mazuwa yose. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Mlavyantamiko ahakigwe mavuta na kusentwa natoze hantu ha ise, nuyo natende umviko wo wivano akatenda kavika suche ikukile ya chitambala chedi ching'aile. <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />Nakukize Hantu Hakukise na kukukiza Idihema Dikukile na kukukiza uwani wo kulaviza ntambiko na kwachausa cha mviko wa walavyantambiko na kwachausa cha wantu wose wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />Ino ni sigilizi ya kutimila mazuwa yose, mwaungwa muidamanye chani kutenda mviko wa wivano kwachausa cha wantu wa Izulaeli nkanana imwenga chila mhilimo na kulekeilwa masa yawo. Musa kadamanya yose saviya asigilwe ni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya wikazi wa utondowazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />Chohile niyo alonga na Musa, <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />Mgambile Haluni na wanawe na wantu wose wa Izulaeli, mbuli ino niyo asigile Zumbe, <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />uneva mntu yoyose mgati mwa Waizulaeli nanilavize miye ntambiko ya ng'ombe hegu ngoto hegu mbuzi mndani hegu kuse kwe nkambi, <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />hanamwigale umnyama uyo kolwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile kumlaviza Zumbe Chohile mntu uyo natende na mlema wa kwitila sakame, ketila sakame nengaswe mwa wantu wa Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Lagizo dino dyawaunga Waizulaeli wamwigaile Zumbe wadya wanyama wakunga wawachinje kwe zinkonde. Nawegale wanyama awo kwa mlavyantambiko kolwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile, uyo nawachinje na kumlaviza Zumbe malavyo ya kulombeza utondowazi. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Ivyo, mlavyantambiko nanyunyize isakame mo wani wo kulaviza ntambiko kwa Zumbe udya wihajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile na kutikimya yadya mavuta yatende mhempe wedi wa kumuwagila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Ivyo Waizulaeli nawahele vitendese kuvikila matukulu yekale enga vulata, mbuli iwalekile waswese uzumizi kwangu. Lagizo dino ni dya kutimilwa mazuwa yose mwe vyeleko vyawo vyose.<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />Wagambile, mntu yoyose mwa Waizulaeli, hegu wajeni, wakwikazanya, akulavya lavyo dya kutikimya hegu lavyo tuhu, <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />mna hakudigala hajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile, chani amlavize Zumbe, mntu uyo nengaswe mwa wantu wakwe.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />Uneva mntu yoyose mwa Wazulaeli hegu mjeni akwikala mgati mwawo adya sakame yoyose, miye nanimwihiwe mntu uyo akudya sakame, na kumwingasa hale na wantu wangu. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Navitende ivyo kwaviya ujima wa chumbe wimwesakame. Siwalagizani kulavya sakame mlanga mo wani kudamanya mviko wa wivano, kwaviya sakame yadamanya wivano wa wikazi wa mntu. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Nivyo vikuleka siwalagizani, mntu yoyose mgati mwenyu hegu mjeni akwikala mgati mwenyu asekudya sakame mpwii.<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />Mntu yoyose mwa Waizulaeli, hegu mjeni anaita kucheseka mnyama hegu kadege, aungwa etile isakame hasi na kuigubika na msanga. <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />Kwaviya ujima wa chila chumbe wimwesakame. Nivyo vikuleka siwasigila wana wa Izulaeli wasekudya sakame ya chumbe chochose, kwaviya ujima wa chumbe chochose wimwesakame. Yoyose nadye nengaswe mwa wantu wakwe.<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />Mntu yoyose atende mkaya hegu mjeni, nadye chifile chenye hegu chikomigwe ni kala dya kumbago aungwa afule izisuche zakwe na kuhaka mazi, uyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi. Ikajinka aho natende ywedi. <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Mna hanafuile izisuche zakwe na kuhaka, mntu uyo nachimlaile namanye mwenye.<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s">Ntendwa zihiye mwe nyinka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />wagambile vino wantu wa Izulaeli, “Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Msekutenda saviya wakutenda wantu wa isi ya Misili kudya mwekalaga, hegu kutenda saviya wakutenda wantu weisi ya Kanani uko huwegaleni. Msekujeza kutimila mazwela yawo. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Namtimile miko yangu na kutoza malagizo yangu. Miye ni Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Mwaungwa mtoze miko yangu na sigilizi zangu chani mwikale, Miye ni Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />“Mntu yoyose ase kuhampikana na mvyele mlukolo ywakwe chani agone naye. Ni Miye Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />“Usekuswesa ntunyo kwa tati yako kwa kugona na nyokwe akweleke. Usekumjela soni uyo ni nyokwe. <verse eid="LEV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />Usekuswesa ntunyo kwa tati yako kwaviya kwa kugona na yumwe ywa wakazize, awo ni wamami zako.”<verse eid="LEV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />“Usekugona na lumbudyo, atende ni lumbudyo mwana iso hegu nyokwe hata hegu kelekwa mnyumba hegu kutuhu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />“Usekugona na mwezukuluwo, mwana mwanawo ywa chilume hegu ywa chiche, kwaviya wejela soni wemwenye.” <verse eid="LEV 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />“Usekugona na mndele elekwe ni mami yako ywa kufikila asoligwe ni tati yako, uyo ni lumbudyo.”<verse eid="LEV 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />“Usekugona na nyokwe sangazi, kwaviya uyo ni lumbudye dya iso, wonka tombo dimwenga.”<verse eid="LEV 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />“Usekugona na lumbudye dya mami yako, kwaviya uyo ni mlukolo ywa hajihi ywa mami yako.<verse eid="LEV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />Usekugona na mkaza iso mkulu hegu iso mdodo uyo ni mami yako.”<verse eid="LEV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />“Usekugona na mkamwanawo, uyo ni mwanawo,<verse eid="LEV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />Usekugona na mkaza mkuluwo hegu mvunawo, nomjele soni walukolo wako.”<verse eid="LEV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />“Unagona na mvyele, usekugona na mwanawe ywa chiche hegu wezukuluwe. Awo ni walukolo kuwahanganya ni kudamanya wavu mkulu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />Usekumguha lumbudye dya mkaziwo atende mchemi wakwe umo mkaziwo achemeso, uko ni kwejela uzavu.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />Usekugona na mvyele akatenda emwa mazuwa yakwe.<verse eid="LEV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />“Usekugona na mkaza mnyawo, nawejela uzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile.”<verse eid="LEV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />“Usekumlavya mwanawo yoyose kutenda lavyo kwa mlungu Moleki kwaviya unadamanya ivyo nohulute idizina dyangu miye Chohile ywako.” Ni miye Zumbe Chohile ywako.<verse eid="LEV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />“Usekujeza kugona na mgosi mnyawo saviya ukugona na mvyele. Uwo ni wavu mkulu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />“Usekugona na mnyama yoyose, chani unase kwejela uzavu. Mgosi hegu mvyele yoyose asekutenda ivyo, kutenda ivyo ni kwejela uzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile.”<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />Msekwejela uzavu kwa kudamanya mbuli saizo, kwachausa cha mbuli saizo nawengasa wantu wa si zikulongozi kwenyu kwaviya wowo wadamanya mbuli saizo na kwejela uzavu mwe sila yo kunivikila. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Isi yawo ijelwa uzavu, miye niyo naikantila kulawana no uzavu wakwe, iyo iwalemela wekazi. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Mna nyuwe na wajeni wakwikala mgati mwenyu mwaungwa mtoze miko yangu na malagizo zangu naho msekutenda mbuli zikunihiza miye. <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />Mbuli zose zikwihiza zatendagwa ni wantu walongolaga kwikala mwe isi ya Kanani nawo waijela isi iyo uzavu. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Ivyo nyuwe msekudamanya mbuli saizo hegu sivyo isi naiwengaseni saviya niwengase wantu walongolaga kwikala umo nyuwe hemwinati.<verse eid="LEV 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />“Ivyo yoyose natende umwenga mo wihi uwo, nengaswe hale na wantu wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />Tozesani yose niwalagizeni chani msekutimila mazwela yoyose yakwiihiza yadamanywe ni wekazi wekalaga nyuwe hemwinati mnase kwejela uzavu kwa mbuli izo. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi mwe kudamanya yedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />Zumbe niyo alonga na Musa, <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" />Wagambe wantu wose wa Izulaeli, “Namtende wakuka, kwaviya miye Zumbe Chohile ywenyu ni mkuka.”<verse eid="LEV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />Chila yumwenga amtunye mami yakwe na tati yakwe, nanywi namtoze Zuwa dyangu dya Kuhumula. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />“Msekuhitukila kutimila matukulu naho msekudamanya matukulu ya kusana na kuyavikila, Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />“Aho mkumlaviza Zumbe lavyo dya kunga utondowazi, mlavizeni saviya msigilwe, ivyo, namzumilwe ni Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Nyama ze idilavyo idyo nazidigwe mwedizuwa idyo dilavigwe na zuwa dya kaidi, mna, chintu chochose chinasigala mwedilavyo idyo kubula zuwa dya katatu chitikimye moto. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Mntu yoyose anadya inyama iyo ye dilavyo isigale kubula zuwa dya katatu, ni ihizo lavyo idyo hadizumilwe. <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />Mna mntu yoyose nadye inyama iyo natende na mlema, kwaviya kakijela uzavu chintu chikukile cha Zumbe Chohile, mntu uyo nengaswe hale na wantu wakwe.”<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />“Umo mkana ulozo mwezinkonde zenyu, msekuvunisa mnkanda mwezinkonde zenyu, naho msekuchisanya ulozu usigale. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Msekuchisanya zabibu zisigale umo mkavuna mwezinkonde zenyu naho msekulogota zabibu zilagale hasi, muwasize wachiwa na wajeni.” Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />“Msekubawa, Msekudanta, hegu kutwilana lulimi, <verse eid="LEV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />msekwelisa kwa udanti kwa zina dyangu, na kudihuluta izina dyangu. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />“Usekumbunyanya mnyawo hegu kumbaila, maliho ya ndima akudamanyize yasekwikala kwako kubula mtondo.<verse eid="LEV 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />Usekumtila chiziwi, hegu kumwikiya chintu chikuchinda mntu tuntu kulongozi kwakwe, mna umogohe Chohile. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywako.”<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />“Mazuwa yose walamuleni wantu vikuwagila usekumhingiza mntu atende mchiwa hegu mgoli, mna vyaungwa umkantile mbuyayo viya kuwagila. <verse eid="LEV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />Usekubwelekeza mbuli za lulimi mgati mwa wantu wako. Usekumhosa mnyawo akomwe kwa milosi yako. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywako.”<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />“Usekumwihiwa mlukolo ywako mo moyo wako, mna mfunde mnyawo mazuwa yose chani unase kutenda masa kwa chausa chakwe.”<verse eid="LEV 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />“Usekuliha chikoda hegu kutenda na chinyulu na yumwe mwa wantu wako mna munge mnyawo saviya ukweunga wemwenye. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywako.”<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />“Waungwa utoze malagizo yangu. Usekuwalekela wanyama wako wakwelwe ni wanyama wesimane, usekuhanda mbeyu mbili zesimane hamwenga mwenkonde yako. Usekuvika suche zilukigwe kulaila mwe vintu vyesimile.”<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />“Hegu mgosi anagona na mvyele mtumwa alombigwa ni mgosi mtuhu mna halavizwe ukombo hegu alekeilwe, nawakantilwe mna wasekukomwa kwaviya mvyele uyo hanati kulekeilwa. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Hata ivyo, mgosi uyo negale lavyo dyakwe dya ndolome ya kusa masa hajihi no lwivi lwe Dihema Dikukile nakunilaviza miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Kwe ndolome iyo yedilavyo dyo kusa mlema, mlavyantambiko namtendele wivano mntu uyo kulongozi kwa Zumbe kwa chausa cha kusa masa adamanye, Chohile namlekeile uyo mntu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />“Aho namwingile mwe isi ya Kanani na kuhanda miti ya matunda yesimile, kwa mihilimo mitatu matunda yakwe hamungwe myadye, myawone kugamba ni mizavu mwe sila ya kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Mna mo mhilimo wa kane matunda yakwe yose nayatende malavyo kwa chausa cha kumwinka Zumbe ntogozi. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Mna mo mhilimo wa shano namdye amatunda yakwe, mnatenda ivyo miti yenyu nayelekese. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />“Msekudya nyama yoyose nesakame yakwe. Msekukaula mlamulo hegu kuloga.”<verse eid="LEV 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />“Msekumonya denge mwe mitwi yenyu, naho msekuwegula izi ndevu zenyu ntendele imwenga.” <verse eid="LEV 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />“Msekwesenga sale mwe mili yenyu kwa chausa cha kulomboleza wantu wabanike naho msekwedolonya mwe mili yenyu, miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />“Usekuwajela soni wandele ywenyu watende wachilanga, mnatenda ivyo wantu wose mwe isi nawameme uchilanga na wavu utendese.”<verse eid="LEV 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />“Tozani mazuwa yangu ya kuhumula, mdituntunye Idihema dyangu Dikukile, miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />“Msekuwabasa wantu walaguzi wakujeseza wazimu hegu wasai wanase kuwajelani mwe uzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />“Ukatenda kulongozi kwa mdalahala waungwa uchimale kulagisa kugamba wamtunya, weye umogohose Chohile ywako. Miye ni Zumbe.”<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />“Ukekala na mjeni mwe isi yako usekumdamanyiza yehiye. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Mjeni akwikala hamwenga na weye natende enga mwelekwa ywenyu, umunge saviya ukweunga we mwenye, kwaviya nyuwe na mwi wajeni mwe isi ya Misili. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />“Msekutenda heyekuwagila umo mkawahimila wantu vintu, vitende mwe kuhima utali hegu uzami hegu kumemya. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Mwaungwa mjeseze vihimo hevikunkonya. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu, niwalavizeni mwe isi ya Misili.”<verse eid="LEV 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />“Tozani malagizo yangu yose na sigilizi zangu zose. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s">Nkanto kwa kudamanya wavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />“Wagambile wantu wa Izulaeli, mntu yoyose mwawo hegu wajeni wakwikala Izulaeli, namlavye mwanawe yoyose na kumwinka mlungu Moleki, vyaungwa akomwe wekazi wose we isi nawamkome kwa kumhuta mayuwe. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Miye mwenye nanimwihiwe uyo mntu na kumwingasa mwa wantu wangu, kwaviya kamlavya mwanawe na kumwinka lavyo mlungu Moleki, chani kujela uzavu Idihema Dikukile na kudihuluta idizina dyangu dikukile. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Naho wakaya we isi iyo wana mleka hawana mkomile hadya nalavye lweleko lwakwe na kumwinka Moleki, hawana mkomile, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />miye mwenye nanimkantile umntu uyo na wantu we kaya yakwe. Naniwakantile file hamwenga na wantu wakwe. Naho nanitende seivyo kwa wantu watuhu waswezize ukanuni kwangu kwa kumbasa mlungu Moleki.”<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />“Uneva mntu yoyose anaita kwa walaguzi wakutimila mizimu nakuswesa ukanuni kwangu, nanimkantile file uyo mntu hamwenga na wantu wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />Elo, kwelenguseni mtende wakuka, kwaviya miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Tozani sigilizi zangu, na kuzidamanya. Miye ni Zumbe huwatendani mtene wakuka.”<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />“Mntu yoyose namligite ise hegu nine chindedi nakomwe. Kamligita ise hegu nine, ivyo sakame zawo nazimuwiye yeye mwenye.”<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />“Uneva mgosi anagona na mvyele ywa mntu mtuhu, heye uyo nagone na mkaza mbuyaye, mgosi mgonyi na mvyele akugonywa, vyaungwa wose waidi wakomwe.” <verse eid="LEV 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />“Mgosi namgonye yumwenga mwa wakaza ise kamjela soni ise, wose waidi chindedi nawakomwe sakame yawo naitende mlanga mwawo.”<verse eid="LEV 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />“Uneva mgosi yoyose anagona na mkamwanawe, wose waidi chindedi vyaungwa wakomwe watenda wavu wihise sakame yawo na itende mlanga mwawo.”<verse eid="LEV 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />“Naho uneva mgosi anagona na mgosi mnyawe saviya akugona na mvyele, wose waidi wadamanya wavu utendese, vyaungwa wakomwe, sakame yawo naitende mlanga mwawo. <verse eid="LEV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />Naho mgosi anasola mvyele hamwenga na nine uwo ni wavu utendese, wose watatu nawokwe moto chani wabanike, chani kusekutenda na wavu mgati mwenyu. <verse eid="LEV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" />Naho mgosi anagonya mnyama, vyaunwga akomwe, seivyo mnyama naye akomwe. <verse eid="LEV 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />Naho uneva mvyele anasogeila mnyama yoyose niyo agonywa numnyama uyo, mumkome umvyele uyo, na mnyama naye vyaungwa akomwe sakame yawo naitende mlanga mwawo.”<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />“Naho mgosi yoyose anasola lumbudye, mwana ise hegu mwana nine na kugonyana uwo ni wavu utendese, wantu awo vyaungwa wengaswe na wantu wawo, uyo mgosi aungwa akantilwe.”<verse eid="LEV 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />“Hegu mgosi anagona na mvyele emwa mazuwa yakwe wose waidi waungwa wengaswe na wantu wawo, kwaviya wabalanga sigilizi ikulemeza wavu.”<verse eid="LEV 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />“Usekugona na lumbudye dya nyokwe, hegu nyokwe sangazi, kwaviya awo ni walukolo wako wa hajihi, wose waidi nawakantilwe ko wavu wawo. <verse eid="LEV 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />Naho mgosi anagona na mkaza ise mkulu hegu ise mdodo, nawajela soni ise mkulu na ise mdodo. Wose waidi nawakantilwe kwa masa yawo nawatende na mlema. Nawakomwe hewena wana. <verse eid="LEV 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />Naho mgosi na msole mkaza mkuluwe hegu ywa mvunawe wakatenda wachei wajima, uwo ni uzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile, wose waidi wakomwe hewena wana.”<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />“Mwaugwa mtoze na kuchintiza malagizo na miko yangu yose. Hegu sivyo isi idya huwegalani mkekale naiwalemeleni. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Msekutimila mazwela ya wantu niguluse kulongozi kwenyu. Kwaviya wowo watenda izimbuli izo zose niyo nawehiwa vitendese. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Mna, miye siwagambilani nyuwe, namwikale mwe isi yawo, miye nami nawenkani isi iyo itende yenyu, si ikuwagila kwa kulima na kudimila. Miye ni Zumbe, Chohile ywenyu, niwasentileni nyuwe na wantu wa si ntuhu. <verse eid="LEV 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />Ivyo, mwaungwa mmanye mnyama suyo mzavu na mnyama mzavu na madege sayo mazavu na madege mazavu mwe sila yo kunivikila. Msekwejela uzavu nyuwe wenye kwa kukufya mnyama hegu kadege hegu chintu chochose chikutamabala mwe isi nisentile kutenda chizavu mwe sila yo kuvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Kwaviya Miye Zumbe Chohile nimkuka siwasentani nyuwe na wantu wa si ntuhu chani mtende wakuka.”<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />“Mgosi hegu mvyele akujeseza mizimu, hegu usai, vyaungwa akomwe kwa kutoigwa mayuwe, sakame yawo naitende mlanga mwawo.”<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo kwa walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />Zumbe kamgamba Musa, “Wagambile walavyantambiko, wana wa Haluni, mntu asekwela uzavu kwa chausa cha kukufya vimba vya wantu wakwe wabanike, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />mna hegu ni ya mlukolo ywakwe ywa hajihi, kugamba mami yakwe hegu tati yakwe hegu mwanawe hegu cha mndele ywakwe hegu ya mkuluwe hegu mvunawe, <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />iviya kwa chausa cha lumbudye mwali, hegu lumbudye ywa hajihi henati kusolwa. Kwachausa cha awo adaha kwejela uzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Kwaviya mlavyantambiko ni mkulu mwa wantu aungwa asekwejela uzavu kwakukufya vimba vya wantu wehaguhi naye kwachausa cha wantu wasolane.”<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />“Walavyantambiko wasekuwegula izifili mwe mitwi yawo kwachausa cha kulomboleza hegu kuwegula izindevu zawo mnkanda naho wasekwesenga sale mwe mili yawo. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Waungwa watende wakuka kwa Chohile ywawo naho wasekudihuluta idizina dya Chohile ywawo. Kwaviya wowo nawo wakudamanya ndima ya kulavya malavyo akwinkigwa Zumbe Chohile yakulavigwa kwa moto, saviya nkande ikulavigwa kwa Chohile ywawo.”<verse eid="LEV 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />“Kwaviya mlavyantambiko kasentwa kwa Chohile ywake, asekusola mvyele mchilanga hegu mvyele afilwe hegu asigwe ni mgosiwe. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Wantu waungwa wamuwone mlavyantambiko kugamba ni mkuka, kwaviya uyo nuyo akulavya malavyo ya nkande kwa Chohile ywako. Kwaviya miye ni mkuka, huwatendani nyuwe wakuka.”<verse eid="LEV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />“Aho mndele ywa mlavyantambiko yoyose nejele uzavu kwa uchilanga, kamjela soni ise, nakomwe kwa kokwa moto.”<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />“Mlavyantambiko mkulu yoyose uyo nuyo mkulu mwa walukolo wakwe uyo kajuluzizwa mavuta momtwi wakwe uyo kasentwa chani avike izisuche izo uyo asekuleka kuchana izifili zakwe naho hatatule suche zakwe kwa kulomboleza. <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />Asekwingila hantu hana mntu abanike hegu kwejela uzavu hata hegu ni ise hegu nine. <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />Kwaviya kasentwa kwa kuhakwa mavuta ya Chohile ywakwe, ivyo asekufosa mwe Dihema Dikukile hegu kuhajela uzavu kwakwita kwingila kwe nyumba ina chimba. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywako.”<verse eid="LEV 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />“Mlavyantambiko mkulu ungwa asole mvyele mta bikila. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Asekusola mvyele afilwe ni mgosiwe hegu mvyele asigwe ni mgosiwe hegu mvyele ejeile uzavu kwa uchilanga, mna nasole mvyele mta bikila mwa wantu wakwe mwenye. Miye ni Chohile nimsentile atende mkuka. <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />Anase kuwajela uzavu wanawe mwa wantu wakwe, kwaviya miye ni Zumbe humtenda mkuka.”<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />Zumbe kalonga na Musa, akagamba, <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />“Mgambe Haluni, mwelekwa ywako yoyose mo lweleko lwako lukwiza, mta chilema mo mwili, hakungigwa kusogela na kunilaviza lavyo dya nkande miye Chohile ywakwe. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Mntu yoyose mta chilema asekunisogeila kunilaviza lavyo atende ni tuntu hegu mta chilema hegu aholomale hegu mta uso usengigwesengigwe, hegu mta na chilunngo chitali chesimile mo mwili, <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />hegu mntu afyokile ichiga hegu afyokile mkono, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />hegu mta chiduva, hegu mntu mjihi vitendese hegu mta belenge hegu mta unyonje wa nkanda hegu bubu hegu mntu abanike amalungula moto. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Mntu yoyose we cheleko cha Haluni mlavyantambiko mta chilema asekusogela kulavya malavyo ya kutikimya kwa moto kwaviya ana chilema, ivyo asekunisogeila kunilaviza miye Chohile lavyo dya nkande. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Mntu uyo adaha kudya mgate wa Chohile ywakwe hegu vintu vikukile hegu vintu vikukise. <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />Mna Kwaviya ana chilema asekudisogeila diya ipaziya hegu uwani wo kulaviza ntambiko anase kuhajela Idihema Dikukile uzavu mwe sila yo kunivikila, kwaviya miye Chohile ni miye huvitende vintu vitende vikuka.”<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Ivyo Musa kamgambila Haluni na wanawe na wana wa Izulaeli mbuli izo zose.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="s">Ukuka wa malavyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />Zumbe kalonga na Musa, akamgamba, <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />“Mgambile Haluni na wanawe wavisinyise ivintu Waizulaeli wakuvisenta kwa chausa changu wanase kudihuluta idizina dyangu dikukile. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="LEV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />Wagambile vino hegu yumwenga mwe vyeleko vyenyu vyose, anatenda mzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile, anavisogeila vintu vikukile Waizulaeli wasentile kwa chausa changu, mntu uyo namumwingase mwa wantu wakwe. Mntu uyo aungwa anisankanile miye naho. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile hulagiza ayo. <verse eid="LEV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />Mntu yoyose mwe cheleko cha Haluni eli mlavyantambiko mta matana hegu mta kulawigwa nufila asekudya vintu vikukile kubula aho natende ywedi. Mntu yoyose akujelwa uzavu kwa kukufya chimba hegu mntu akulawigwa ni mbeyu za chilume, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />hegu mntu nakufye chumbe chochose chikutambala chikumjela mntu uzavu hegu anamkufya mntu yoyose akudaha kumjela uzavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile hegu uzavu wowose, <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />ivyo, mlavyantambiko uyo natende mzavu kubula chisingi naho haungwe adye vintu vikukile kubula aho nahake mazi. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Zuwa dikaswa natende ywedi, akaheza aho nadahe kudya mwe vintu vikukizwe, kwaviya ni nkande yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Mlavyantambiko asekudya nyama yoyose ifile yenye hegu mnyama akomigwe ni kala dya kumbago, asekwejela uzavu. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />“Ivyo, vyaungwa walavyantambiko watoze malagizo yangu, chani wanase kukola masa na kubanika. Miye ni Zumbe Chohole huwakukiza.”<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />“Mtu suyo mlukolo ywa walavyantambiko hakugwa kudya malavyo ya nkande ikukile, hata mjeni ywa mlavyantambiko hegu mndima ywakwe haungigwe adye malavyo ayo. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Mna uneva mlavyantambiko anagula mtumwa atende ywakwe, elo, mtumwa uyo na welekwa wakwe wadaha kudya lavyo idyo dye nkande iyo ikukile. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Uneva mndele ywa mlavyantambiko kasolwa ni mntu suyo mlavyantambiko, mndele uyo hakungigwa akadya inkande iyo ye dilavyo. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Mna uneva mndele ywa mlavyantambiko kafilwa hegu kasigwa ni mgosiwe, naho hana wana, akaheza kauya na kwikala mwe nyumba ya tati yakwe, saviya mo zana wakwe, uyo nadye mwe nkande iyo ikukile.”<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />“Uneva mntu yoyose anadya mwe chintu chiya chikukizwe hemanyize, amlihe mlavyantambiko chintu icho adile na kongezeza fungu dimwenga mwe mashano dya yombe dye ichintu icho. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Walavyantambiko wasekuvijela uzavu vintu vikukile vikulavigwa ni Waizulaeli kwangu miye Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />kwa kuwalekeila wantu sawo walavyantambiko kudya ivintu ivyo vikukile nawegaile malema. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile huvikukiza ivintu ivyo.”<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavyo heyekuzumilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Zumbe kalonga na Musa, akamgamba, <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />“Mgambile Haluni na wanawe walavyantambiko na Waizulaeli wose kugamba, mntu yoyose mgati mwenyu, hegu mjeni akwikala mwa Waizulaeli, akalavya lavyo dyakwe dya kuchintiza chiya alagane hegu lavyo dyakwe dya kunga mwenye kumlaviza Zumbe Chohile lavyo dya kutikimya, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />chani lavyo idyo dizumilwe nalavye mwe zing'ombe zakwe njeku hegu mwe izindolome zakwe hegu mwamavulata yakwe alavye heine lema. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Msekulavya chochose chiya china lema kwaviya hachihokelwe kwa chausa chenyu. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Mntu yoyose namlavize Zumbe lavyo dya kulombeza utondowazi, kulaila mwa wanyama wakwe hegu ni kwachausa cha kuchintiza cheliso chakwe hegu kunga mwenye kumlaviza Chohile chani azumilwe mnyama uyo asekutenda na lema dyodyose. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Usekumlaviza Zumbe Chohile mnyama yoyose tuntu hegu avunike hantu hohose hegu aholomale hegu mta nkwenje hegu mta uhele hegu mta mkuje. Mnyama sauyo usekujeza kumlavya lavyo dya kutikimya mlanga mo wani wo kutikimiza malavyo kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Njeku hegu ndolome ina chiga chitali hegu chijihi chitendese yadaha kulavigwa lavyo dya mntu akunga mwenye kumlaviza Zumbe Chohile, mna mnyama uyo asekulavigwa kwachausa cha lavyo dya mntu kuchintiza chiya alagane. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Mnyama yoyose alumile amalungula moto hegu kukantwa hegu kuhondwa hegu chitulwa hegu chisengwa, msekunilaviza miye Zumbe Chohile, naho msekutenda mbuli saivyo mwe isi yenyu. <verse eid="LEV 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />Naho usekuhokela kulaila kwe wajeni wanyama sa awo na kunilaviza miye Chohile enga nkande. Wanyama awo wana vilema kwaviya wakantwa na hawazumilwe kwa chausa chenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Zumbe kalonga na Musa, akamgamba, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />“Aho ndama hegu ndolome hegu vulata vikelekwa, natende hamwenga na nine kwa mazuwa mfungate. Mna kukongela zuwa dya mnane adaha kulavigwa kwa Chohile lavyo dya kulavigwa kwa Zumbe kwa sila ya kutikimya. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Usekuchinja ng'ombe hegu ngoto hamwenga na mwanawe zuwa dimwenga.”<verse eid="LEV 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lavyo dya ntogozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />“Umo ukanilaviza lavyo dya ntogozi miye Zumbe Chohile, nodilavye mwe sila ikukutenda weye uzumilwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Mnyama uyo aungwa adigwe idizuwa idyo msekusigaza chochose kubula luvi dyakwe mtondo.” Miye ni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />“Ivyo mtoze malagizo yangu na kuyadamanya. Miye ni Zumbe Chohie huwalagizani. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Msekudihuluta zina dyangu dikukile, wantu wose wa Izulaeli waungwa wamanye kugamba miye ni mkuka. Huwatendani nyuwe wakuka. <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />Miye nuyo niwalavize mwe isi ya Misili, chani nitende Chohile ywenyu. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo mwe Zuwa dya Kuhumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />Zumbe kalonga na Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />Wagambile wana wa Izulaeli, kugamba, zino nizo izingasu nikiye yano mazuwa mkungwa mdugane hamwenga na kunivikila.<verse eid="LEV 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuwa dya kuhumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />Namdamanye ndima mazuwa mtandatu, mna zuwa dya mfungate ni Zuwa dya Kuhumula, zuwa idyo msekudamanya ndima mna duganani mnivikile. Zuwa idyo dyo kuhumula ni zuwa dyangu dikukile, mwaungwa mditoze kokose namwikale.<verse eid="LEV 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngasu ya Pasaka na mgate Hewigwaduswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />Kuna ngasu ntuhu miye nikiye nazitende mazuwa yakukile, izo namdugane hamwenga mnivikile.<verse eid="LEV 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />“Chisingi cha zuwa dya mlongo na nne dyo mwezi wa nkongo namdamanye kwa kunitunya miye Zumbe Chohile, ngasu ya Pasaka. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Zuwa dikutimila idyo dya mlongo na shano dyo mwezi uwo naikonge ngasu ya Migate Heigwaduswe kwa mazuwa mfungate namdye migate heigwaduswe. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Zuwa dya nkongo msekudamanya ndima yoyose mdugane mnivikile. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Mwa mazuwa yose ayo mfungate namnilavize miye Zumbe Chohile malavyo ya Kutikimya. Mwedizuwa dya mfungate namleke ndima zose na kudugana hamwenga chani mnivikile.”<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngasu ya malimbulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />Zumbe kalonga na Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />“Wagambile Waizulaeli, aho namwingile mwe isi iyo huwenkani nakuvuna ulozo wakwe, namumwigaile mlavyantambiko chisa dya malimbulo. <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />Mwedizuwa dikutimila dikaheza Idizuwa dyo Kuhumula mlavyantambiko nadinule idyo idichisa saviya chilagiso cha kumlaviza Zumbe Chohile, chani mdahe kuzumilwa. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Mwedizuwa idyo mkadamanya chilagiso cha kunilaviza idyo idichisa, iviya namnilavize miye Chohile lavyo dya kutikimya lavyo dya ndolome ya mhilimo umwenga heina lema. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Hamwenga nedilavyo idyo namlavye lavyo dya unga usungigwe vyedi chilo mbili uhanganywe na mavuta ya mizaituni, iyo namnilavize miye Zumbe Chohile kwa moto, mhempe wakwe nauniwagile. Iviya hamwenga na ayo namnigaile lavyo dya kuywa kugamba lita imwenga ya divai. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Zuwa idyo hedinati dyo kunigaila miye Chohile amalavyo ayo hamkungwa kudya amalimbulo yenyu, utende ni mbisi hegu yakazigwa hegu yokigwa hegu idamanywa migate. Dino ni lagizo dya kutimila mazuwa yose hohose namwikale.”<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngasu ya kulozola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />“Namuwaze majuma mfungate yachintile kukongela mwedizuwa diya mlavyantambiko enule diya idichisa saviya chilagiso cha kunilaviza miye. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Mwe zuwa dya milongo mishano mwe zuwa dya kuhumula namnilavize lavyo dya nkande mpya. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Chila lukolo nalwigale migate midi ya lavyo dya kulavya kwa chilagiso kulongozi kwangu miye Chohile. Chila mgate vyaungwa udamanywe kwa chilo mbili za unga usungigwe vyedi ugwaduswe, uwo namnilavize miye Zumbe Chohile malavyo ya malimbulo. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Hamwenga na ayo namlavye ndolome mfungate za mhilimo umwenga hezine vilema, na njeku imwenga, na ndolome mbili zitende lavyo dya kutikimya kwa Zumbe, hamwenga na lavyo dyawo dya unga na malavyo yawo ya kunywa. Lavyo dina mhempe ukuwagila dilavigwe kwa Zumbe kwa sila ya moto. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Namlavye vulata dimwenga kutenda lavyo dya wavu na ndolome mbili za mhilimo umwenga kutenda malavyo ya utondowazi. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Mlavyantambiko nenule kulanga kulagisa kugamba ni malavyo yakulavya kwa hamwenga na mgate wa malimbulo hamwenga na ziya izindolome mbili. Vintu ivyo vikuka kwa Zumbe Chohile navyo navitende vya mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Mwedizuwa idyo na mlonge nakutende na mdugano ukukile msekudamanya ndima yoyose. Dino ni lagizo dya mazuwa yose mo wikazi wenyu mwe vyeleko vyenyu vyose.”<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />“Aho mkuvunila ulozo mwezinkonde zenyu, msekubinda kuvuna mwe mihaka yezinkonde zenyu naho msekuya kunyuma mkasokoza. Nowasize wachiwa na wajeni. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuwa dya wivano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />Zumbe kalonga na Musa, akamgamba, <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />Wagambile wana wa Izulaeli. Mwezi wa mfungate zuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi, nakutende na mbwedo vitendese kwenyu ni lukumbusa lwa kutowa magunda, ni mdugano mkuka. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Msekudamanya ndima yoyose ya undima nyuwe namlavye lavyo kwa Zumbe kwa sila ya kutikimya.<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zuwa dya kulekeilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />Zumbe kalonga na Musa, amgamba, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />“Mwedizuwa dya mlongo dyo mwezi uno wa mfungate ni zuwa dya kulekeilwa naditende zuwa dya mdugano mkuka kwenyu. Namfunge na kulavya lavyo akulavizwa Zumbe kwa sila ya moto. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Nyuwe msekudamanya ndima mwe dizuwa idyo kwaviya zuwa idyo ni dya kulekeilwa, chani mtendelwe wivano wenyu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Kwaviya mntu yoyose hekufunga mwedizuwa idyo vyaungwa engaswe hale na wantu wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Mntu yoyose akudamanya ndima yoyose mwedizuwa idyo, uyo nanimbalange mgati mwa wantu wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Msekudamanya ndima. Dino nilagizo dya mazuwa yose mo lweleko lwenyu, na mo wikazi wenyu wose. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Naditende zuwa dya kuhumula kwenyu vitendese, namfunge zuwa dya chenda dyo mwezi chipindi cha chisingi, kukongela chisingi kubula chisingi chikutimila, namtoze zuwa dyenyu dya kuhumula.”<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zuwa dya ngasu ya makumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />Zumbe kalonga na Musa akamgamba, <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />“Longa na wana wa Izulaeli uwagambe zuwa dya mlongo na shano dyo mwezi uwo wa zuwa dya kuhumula ni zuwa ngasu ya makumbi kwa mazuwa mfungate kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Zuwa dya nkongo nakutende na mdugano ukukile msekudamanya ndima yoyose ya undima. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Mazuwa mfungate na mumlavize Zumbe malavyo ya kutikimya, zuwa dya mnane nakutende na mdugano ukukile kwenyu namumlavize Zumbe lavyo kwa moto ni mdugano wa chindedi uno msekudamanya ndima yoyose ya undima.”<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />“Yano nayo mazuwa ya mgasu kwa Zumbe, yadya namvinile mwe mdugano mkuka na mumlavize Zumbe malavyo yakulavigwa kwa moto, malavyo ya kutikimya na malavyo ya nkande na malavyo ya kunywa, chila yumwenga mwe zuwa dyakwe, <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />ukausa yadya malavyo ya Mazuwa yo Kuhumula ya Zumbe na ukausa yadya malavyo yenyu, yadya mkumlaviza Zumbe.”<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />“Haluse, zuwa dya mlongo na shano dyo mwezi wa mfungate, aho nambindile kuvuna ulozo mwezinkonde, namwike zuwa dya ngasu dya Zumbe chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate zuwa dya nkongo nakutende na chinyemi vitendese na zuwa dya mnane nakutende na chinyemi vitendese. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Mwe zuwa dya nkongo namguhe matunda yedi ye miti na makuti ya mitende na matambi ya miti inamani yalozize na matambi ya miti ikuhota mnkanda mo mto, nanywi namzenge makumbi namwikale nakudamanya chimemi kulongozi kwa Zumbe kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Namditoze ditende zuwa kulu kwa Zumbe chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate kwa ntunyo ya Zumbe Chohile. Dino ni lagizo dya kutimilwa mazuwa yose mwe vyeleko vyenyu. Namuijese mo mwezi wa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Wantu wose wa Izulaeli namwikale mwe makumbi kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />Mbuli ino naiwatende welekwa wenyu lumanye kugamba nasiwaika wana wa Izulaeli mwe makumbi, aho nawegalaga kulaila isi ya Misili miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Musa kawagambila wana wa Izulaeli amazuwa ayo ye izingasu za Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s">Kutunduliya izita mwe Dihema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />Zumbe niyo alonga na Musa amgamba, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />“Wagambe wana wa Izulaeli wakwigaile mavutaya yedi ya mizaituni kwa chausa che izita chani zake mazuwa yose. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Haluni akoleze izita izo nakuzika mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile, kuse kwe dipaziya dye Dishanduku dye Dilagano kulongozi kwangu chani zake nechilo kubula mtondo. Dino ni lagizo dya kutimilwa mazuwa yose mwe vyeleko vyenyu. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Taa izo nazike mwe chiya cha kwiya taa cha zahabu yedi zake kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Migate ikulavigwa kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />“Guhe unga usungigwe vyedi chilo imwenga, udamanye migate mlongo na midi. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Migate iyo naikwe mwe misitale midi mlanga mwe meza yedi ya zahabu ikulongozi kwa Zumbe, chila msitale migate mtandatu. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Chila msitali we migate iyo noujele ubani wedi mwe vikombe vya zahabu chani wokigwe utende hantu ha lavyo dya kutikimya hantu hemigate. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Chila zuwa dya Kuhumula Haluni naike migate mihya mwe msitale kulongozi kwangu miye Zumbe Chohile kwa chausa cha wantu wa Izulaeli saviya lagano dya mazuwa yose. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Haluni na wanawe awodu nawo wakungwa wadye imigate iyo kwaviya ikukisa, naidigwe hantu hakukile lavyo hulavizwa miye Zumbe Chohile kwa moto mazuya yose.”<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanto kwa kumhuluta Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Zuwa dimwenga kwe nkambi ya Waizulaeli kwalailaga nkumbizi ya Mwizulaeli yumwenga na mbwanga mtuhu mami yakwe endaga Mwizulaeli mna tati yakwe endaga Mmisili. <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Mbwanga uyo mami yakwe endaga Mwizulaeli, nine naketengwa Selemoti mndele mwana ywa Dibuli kulaila mwedikabila dya Dani, kadihuluta na kudibela idizina dya Zumbe. Wantu niyo wamwigala kwa Musa. <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />Niyo wamvugaila mndani mwe nyumba, kubula aho nawabunkwilwe ivyo Zumbe akunga. <verse eid="LEV 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />“Mtalize uyo mbwanga ahulute mlavyeni kuse kwe nkambi, wadya wose wamwivile akahuluta waike imikono yawo mlanga mo mtwi wakwe, ukaheza mdugano wose na wamkome kwa kumtowa mayuwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Wenawe uwagambe Waizulaeli kugamba, mntu yoyose namhulute Chohile ni mbuli yakwe mwenye. <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />Mntu yoyose atende ni mkaya hegu mjeni nahulute zina dya Zumbe, nakomwe kwa kutoigwa mayuwe ni wantu wose wa Izulaeli.”<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />“Mntu yoyose akukoma mntu, vyaungwa akomwe, <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />na mntu yoyose nakome mnyama ywa mnyawe, natozwe maliho ya mnyama emeso alihile yudya akomile.”<verse eid="LEV 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />“Mntu yoyose namlumize myawe, augwa naye alumizwe seivyo amlumize mnyawe, <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />uneva anamtula vuha naye atulwe vuha, anamtula ziso naye atulwe ziso, anamtula zino naye atulwe zino. Chila akumlumiza mnyawe naye alumizwe seivyo amlumize mnyawe. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Mntu nakome mnyama ywa mnyawe vyaungwa alavye maliho, mna nakome mntu naye nakomwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Sigilizi ino yalanga mntu mkaya hegu mjeni, miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Ivyo, Musa niyo awagambila Waizulaeli, nawo niyo wamwigala kuse kwe nkambi yudya mbwanga ahulute idizina dya Zumbe, wamkoma kwa kumtowa mayuwe. Waizulaeli nivyo wadamanye saviya Zumbe Chohile amsigile Musa.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s1">Mhilimo wa mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />Zumbe Chohile niyo alonga na Musa kulanga kolugulu lwa Sinai, <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />“Wagambile Waizulaeli, aho nambule mwe isi huwenkani miye Zumbe, chila mhilimo wa mfungate isi ilekwe isekulimwa kwachausa cha ntunyo yangu miye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Kwa mihilimo mtandatu namlime mwe sanga na kuhanda, namsume zabibu zenyu na kuvuna ulozo wenyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Mna mhilimo wa mfungate nautende wa kuhumula, ni wa Zumbe Chohile. Msekuhanda chochose mwezinkonde zenyu hegu kuhogola amatambi ye mizabibu yenyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Msekuvuna chintu chochose chihotile chenye hegu kusuma zabibu kulaila mwe miti heihogolwe amatambi. Uwo naute mhilimo wa kuleka isanga ye iyo isi ihole <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Hata hegu isi hailimwe mo mhilimo uwo mna nailavye nkande kwa chausa chenyu na watumwa na wasunta viya wenyu na wandima wenyu na wajeni mkwikazanya. <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />Iviya wanyama wenyu wa ludimo nawadye na makala ya kumbago mkwikazanya nayadye nkande kulaila mwe isi mo mhilimo uwo.”<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngasu ya mhilimo wa milongo mishano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />“Namuwaze mihilimo mfungate nkanana mfungate ya Kuhumula, iyo naitende mihilimo milongo mine na chenda. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Mkaheza, mwedizuwa dya mlongo dyo mwezi wa mfungate, idyo idizuwa dyokudamanyizwa wivano namsigile mntu atowe gunda mwe isi yose. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Mhilimo wa mihilimo milongo mishano, namuutunye nakulonga kulekeilwa watumwa wose mwe isi. Mhilimo uwo nautende ni chinyemi cha kukumbuka mihilimo milongo mishano. Chila yumwenga nauye kougoli wakwe na kwenyumba yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Kwaviya mhilimo uwo ni chinyemi cha lukumbusa lwa mihilimo milongo mishano, msekuhanda mbeyu hegu kuvuna chochose chikuhota chenye hegu kuvuna zabibu kulaila mwe miti hemwihogole. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Mhilimo uwo ni Chinyemi kwenyu, nautende ukukile kwa chausa cha Zumbe. Ivyo namdye yadya yakuhota yenye mwezinkonde.”<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />Mo mhilimo uwo we chinyemi sanga yoyose itagigwe ivuzwe komwenye. <verse eid="LEV 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />Ukataga hegu kugula nkonde ya mnyawo, usekumbunyanya. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Yombe dye nkonde iyo dyaungwa diligane ne mihilimo isigale kubula chinyemi chituhu heinati kuvuzwa komwenye. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Hegu imihilimo ikuligana iloza nawongeze idiyombe hegu ni mijeche nohunguze idiyombe, kwaviya yombe dyakwe nadihimwe kuligana na ulozo ukuvunwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Msekunkonyana, mna mumogohe Chohile ywenyu. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />“Ivyo, namtimile miko yangu na sigilizi zangu chani mjendeleze kwikala vyedi mwe isi.<verse eid="LEV 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Isi na yeleke luvuno lwake, nanywi namdye na kwiguta na kwikala vyedi. <verse eid="LEV 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />Mna mwadaha kweuza, Chadya mbwani mo mhilimo wa mfungate uneva hachinahandile hegu kuvuna ulozo wetu.” <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Miye Zumbe naniijimbike isi mo mhilimo wa mtandatu, nayo naiwenkeni ulozo ukuchinta kwa mihilimo mitatu. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Umo mkahanda mo mhilimo wa mnane, namtende mwadya ulozo wombili, namjendeleze kudya kubula mhilimo wa chenda namkonge kulozola naho.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukombola nkonde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />Sanga isekujeza kutagwa ulonaulo mpwii, kwaviya isi ni ugoli wangu na nyuwe mwi wajeni na watafi mwe isi yangu.<verse eid="LEV 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Nivyo vikuleka mwe isi namtende na mwalo wa kukombola nkonde. <verse eid="LEV 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />Uneva mlukolo ywako ni mchiwa niyo ataga inkonde yakwe, elo, mlukolo ywakwe ywa hajihi akungwa aikombole, naikombole. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Uneva uyo atagile hana mlukolo ywahajihi ywa kukombola, mna nyumani anatenda mgoli na kupata udahi wa kuikombola inkonde yakwe, <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />ivyo, nawaze imihilimo kukongela aho aitagile na kuliha yombe dyakwe, yudya mntu aiguile vyaungwa amvuzize. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Mna uneva hana udahi wa kuikombola, elo, neisigaile kwa yuda aiguile kubula mwe ngasu ya kukumbuka mihilimo milongo mishano. Mo mhilimo uwo vyaungwa ugoli uwo ulekelwe uvuzwe kwa yudya mwenye atagile.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />Uneva mntu anataga nyumbakwe akwikala imndani mwe mzi uzengelwe chiwambaza, adaha kuikombola mwe mhilimo umwenga kukongela aho aitagile. Kwa mhilimo uwo mjima anauwagilwa wa kuikombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Uneva nyumba imwemzi uzengelwe uwa haikombolwe kwa chipindi cha mhilimo umwenga, ivyo inyumba iyo ni ugoli wa yudya aiguile mazuwa yose mwe vyeleko vyawo vyose, naho haivuzwe mwe chinyemi cho lukumbusa lwe mihilimo milongo mishano. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Mna nyumba za mwezikaya hezi zungulusizwe uwa nazitende mwe sigilizi idya ye nkonde, nyumba izo zadaha zikombolwe mwe mhilimo umwenga, mna vyaungwa zivuzwe kwa awenye mo mhilimo wo lukumbusa lwa mihilimo milongo mishano. <verse eid="LEV 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />Hamwenga na ivyo, nyumba zimwemizi ikwikalwa ni Walawi, zadaha kukombolwa chipindi chochose. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Uneva yumwenga mwa awo Walawi hakujeseza uwagilwa wakwe wo kukombola, ivyo, nyumba itagigwe yaungwa ivuzwe komwenye mo mhilimo wo lukumbusa lwe mihilimo milongo mishano, kwaviya nyumba zimwe mizi wakwikala Walawi ni ugoli wawo kulaila mwa wantu wa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Mna luwala lwa kudimila zitozigwe ni Walawi kwa hamwenga lusekutagwa, kwaviya uwo ni ulisi wawo mazuwa yose.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwakopesha wachiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />Uneva mlukolo ywako ni mchiwa kubula hakudaha kwetunduliya mwenye akatenda ehamwenga na weye, vyaungwa umtunduliye ajendeleze kwikala na weye mdamanyize enga mjeni hegu mtafi. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Usekunga akulihe chikongezekela chochose mwe chiya umwinkile. Mna mogohe Chohile ywako, chani mlukolo ywako ekale na weye vyedi. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Usekumkopesha hela kwa kunga chikongezeka, hegu kumwinka nkande kwa kunga chongezeko. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Usekujala kugamba miye ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako hulavize kwe isi ya Misili chani hwinke isi ya Kanani, naho nitende Chohile ywako.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulekelwa kwa Watumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />“Uneva mlukolo ywako akwikala hajihi na weye katenda mchiwa, anetaga kwako usekumtenda enga mtumwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Nekale na weye saviya mndima ahakilwe hegu mtafi. Nakudamanyize ndima kubula mwe chinyemi che mihilimo milongo mishano. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Mo mhilimo uwo waungwa umlekele uyo hamwenga na wanawe wauye koulisi wa wadalahala wawo. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Kwaviya Waizulaeli ni wandima wangu, niwalavize mwe isi ya Misili, ivyo, wasekutagwa enga watumwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Use kumlongoza mlukolo ywako kwa ukali, mna mvikile Chohile ywako. <verse eid="LEV 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />Mwa watumwa wako wachiche na wachilume wadaha kuwagula kulaila mwe izisi ntuhu zikuzunguluke. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Naho wadaha kugula watumwa kulaila mwa wajeni mkwikazanya, na welekwa wawo welekelwe mwe isi yenyu, awo nawatende ni ugoli wako. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Watumwa awo wadaha uwenke wanawo watende ulisi wawo mazuwa yose. Awo wadaha kuwatenda watumwa, mna kwa mlukolo ywako Mwizulaeli, homlongoze kwa ukali.”<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />“Uneva mjeni hegu mtafi akwikala mgati mwenyu katenda mgoli na mlukolo ywako atenda mchiwa, na kwetaga kwa uyo mjeni hegu kwa uyo mtafi hegu kwa yumwenga ywa walukolo wawo, <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />adaha kukombolwa eze etage, yumwe mwa walukolo wakwe adaha kumkombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />Mtumbawe hegu mwihwawe hegu mlukolo ywa hajihi mo lukolo lwakwe, hegu katenda mgoli adaha kwekombola mwenye. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Uyo, wakajesanya na uyo amgwile, nawaze mligano we mihilimo kukongela etagile kubula mwe chinyemi cho lukumbusa lwe mihilimo milongo mishano. Yombe dyo kulekelwa kwakwe na diligane ne mihilimo adamanyize ndima. Chipindi chose endaga mtumwa kwa sekulu ywakwe nauhimwe saviya chipindi cha mtu ahakilwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Hegu kusigala mihilimo ilozize kubula mo lukumbusa lwe mihilimo milongo mishano, vyaungwa alihe yombe kulu kuligana ne diyombe agulagwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Hegu kusigala mihilimo mijeche du kubula mo lukumbusa lwe chinyemi che mihilimo milongo mishano, nawaze idiyombe disigale kuligana ne mihilimo iyo na kumliha uwo ukombo. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Chipindi chose nekale kwa sekulu nywakwe vyaungwa uyo amguile asekumlongoza kwa ukali, mna amdamanyizwe saviya mndima ahakilwe chila mhilimo. <verse eid="LEV 25:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Mna uneva mntu uyo ne nyumbakwe hawakombolwe mwe zisila izo, uyo na wanawe walekelwe mo mhilimo wo lukumbusa lwe ngasu ye mihilimo milongo mishano. <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />Waizulaeli ni wandima wangu, kwaviya nawalavyaga mwe isi ya Misili.” Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ujimbiko kwa kunyanyahala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />Zumbe niyo agamba, “Msekwedamanyiza matukulu ya milungu yo udanti, msekutoza matukulu yawo ya kusongola hegu nguzo hegu matukulu ya mayuwe yosongolwe mwe isi yenyu na kuvifikila madi. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Tozani mazuwa yangu yo Kuhumula na kuditunya Idihema dyangu Dikukile. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />“Uneva mnatimila imiko yangu na kutoza malagizo yangu, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />naniwanyesezeni fula mwechipindi chikuwagila chani isi ilavye ulozo ulozese, imiti nayo mwezinkonde zenyu nayeleke matunda yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Kuhuta ingano nakujendeleze kubula chipindi cha kuvuna zabibu, kuvuna zabibu nakujendeleze kubula chipindi cha kuhanda mbeyu. Na mdye nkande zenyu na kwiguta, na kwikala vyedi mwe isi yenyu.”<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />“Naniwenkeni utondowazi mwe isi kubula mdahe kugona hehena kogofyo ni chintu. Nanuse makala yehiye mwe isi na isi yenyu haigwelwe ni nkondo. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Wankondo wenyu namuwabalaze na kuwakoma kwa mabamba. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Wantu wenyu washano nawawabalaze wankondo wenyu gana na wantu wenyu gana nawabalaze wankondo magana gana mlongo umwenga. Wankondo wenyu nawakomwe kulongozi kwenyu kwa bamba. <verse eid="LEV 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />Naniwajimbikeni na kuwatenda mtende na wana walozize chani mjenyele, Nanichintize lagano dyangu na nyuwe. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Chipindi chokulozola namtende mchei na nkande ya mbili, ivyo naviwaunge muse yombili chani mwike mhya. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Nanikale mgati mwenyu mwe Dihema dyangu Dikukile, naho saniwaseni. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Na nijende mgati mwenyu nakutenda Chohile wenyu nanywi namtende wantu wangu. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenu, niwalavizeni mwe isi ya Misili chani msekutenda watumwa wawo. Siwausizani nkuto namnanazo chani mjende uchimala.”<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanto kwa wantu hewekunyanyahala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />“Mna uneva hamna nivile hegu kutimila malagizo yangu, <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />uneva mnabela imiko yangu na kulemela malagizo yangu na kuziihiwa sigilizi zangu zose na kubalanga lagano dyangu, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />elo, miye nanitende vino, naniwatoweni kwa kuwegaila nkama nkulu kwa chipumpa na unyonje wa chifuwa chikulu na homa naiwatuleni ameso na kuwasokezani. Namhande mbeyu zenyu mna ni vyabule kwaviya wankondo wenyu nawo nawadye. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Miye saniwatunduliye nyuwe namtoigwe ni wankondo wenyu, naho namlongozwe ni wadya wakuwaihiwani. Namtiswe na kuguluka hata hegu hahana mntu yoyose akuwagulusani.”<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />“Mna hegu mkaheza kukantilwa seivyo, hamnive, nani jendeleze kuwakantilani nkanana mfungate kwa masa yenyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Nanibalange kasidi kenyu kwa kutenda ulanga utoge enga chuma, isi yenyu saniinyeseze fula ivyo naitoge enga shaba. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Namjeseze nguvu zenyu vya bule kwaviya nkonde zenyu hazilavye ulozo na miti mwe isi yenyu hayeleke matunda.”<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />“Uneva mnajendeleza kunihiga na kulemela kuniva, na nijendeleze kuwatowa nkanana mfungate kuligana na masa yenyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Naniwegaileni makala mgati mwenyu nayapempule wanenyu na kudya awanyama wenyu na kuwahunguza mtende wajeche mo kuwazwa kwenyu na sila zenyu hazitende na wantu wakujinka.”<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />“Uneva nkanto iyo inaheza mchei hamkunihitukila, mna mwajendeleza kuhigana na miye, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />ivyo, nami nanihigane na nyuwe na kuwakantila nkanana mfungate kuligana na masa yenyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Nanigale manyonje heyekuhoa mwenyu kuliha chikoda kwachausa cha lagano mbalange. Nyuwe namsumkile kwemizi yenyu, mna naniwegaileni unyonje wihiye hewikuhona, na kuwaleka mhudwe ni wankondo wenyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Nanihunguze nkande yenyu kubula wavyele mlongo nawoke migate yose mwe ziko dimwenga. Hata mnaheza kudya hamwigute.”<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />“Uneva ayo yose yanajinka hamnive, na kujendeleza kunihiga, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />elo, nami nanihigane na nyuwe kwa maya yatendese na kuwakantilani miye mwenye nkanana mfungate kwa masa yenyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Ngumbo naditendese naho namdye nyama za wanenyu wachilume na wachiche. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Hantu henyu hokuvikila kwamagulu nanihabalange, nchanja zenyu zo kuvunkiziza ubani nanzitule, na kudula vimba vyenyu mlanga mwe matukulu ye milungu yenyu, nami naniwaihiweni vitendese. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Mizi yenyu naniibalange, hantu henyu hakukile nanihatende jangwa na mhempe wedi wa malavyo yenyu saniuzumile. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Isi yenyu naniibalange hata wankondo wenyu wasamila umo nawehelwe. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Naniwatimuleni mgati mwa wantu watuhu wawagulseni kwa mabamba. Isi yenyu naitende uchiwa na mizi yenyu mahame. <verse eid="LEV 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />Nyuwe mnahudya na wankondo wenyu, aho isi nayelelwe amazuwa yakwe yo kuhumula umo naitende nchiwa. Isi naiheme na kwelelwa mazuwa yakwe yo kuhumula. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Ivyo isi ikatende nchiwa, naipate kuhumula hantu hayapataga kuhumula mwa mazuwa yenyu yo kuhumula umo namkaikala.”<verse eid="LEV 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />“Wamwenga wenyu nawasigaile, naniwajele woga mwe myoyo yawo, mwe isi ya wankondo wawo hata zani dikafiliswa nadiwaguluse. Nawaguluke enga mntu akusumka nkondo. Nawaguluke na kugwa hata hegu hahana mntu akuwagulusa. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Nawagwelane enga mntu akusumka nkondo hata hegu hahana akuwagulusa. Hamtende na nguvu zozose za kuhigana na wankondo wenyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Namkomwe mgati mwa wantu wa si ntuhu, na izisi za wankondo wenyu namhabwe uko. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Hegu wamwenga wenyu nawasigaile mwe izisi za wankondo wenyu, nawahwe kwachausa cha wavu wawo na kwachausa cha wavu wa wakale wawo.”<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />“Mna uneva waneila amasa yawo na masa ya wakale wawo wadamanye kwa kunihituka miye na kuhigana kwawo na miye, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />wanabunkula kwambwani nasihigana nawo na kuwegala kwesi za wankondo wawo uneva chindedi moyo mdala una nyanyahala na kweila masa yawo, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />elo, nami nanikumbuke lagano dyangu na Yakobo, nanikumbuke naho lagano dyangu na Isaka naho lagano dyangu na Bulahimu, na kukumbuka isi idya nawelisizaga. <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Umo nawatende wekuse kwe isi yawo, isi nayelelwe mazuwa yakwe yo kuhumula ikatenda nchiwa ikawaleka. Chipindi icho wowo naweile masa yawo ya kubela miko yangu na kwihiwa malagizo yangu. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Mna mwa ayo yose wakatenda wekwezisi za wankondo wawo, miye saniwadule hegu kuwehiwa kubula niwakome wose kwaviya miye ni Chohile ywawo. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Bule! Kwachausa chawo nanikumbuke lagano nidamanye na wakale wawo wadya nilavize kwe isi ya Misili, wantu wa si ntuhu zikasinya chani miye nitende Chohile ywawo. Miye ni Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="LEV 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Ayo nayo malagizo, na sigilizi na miko Zumbe Chohile awenkaga wantu wa Izulaeli ko Lugulu lwa Sinai kujinkila kwa Musa.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi mwa majeleko kwa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />Zumbe niyo alonga na Musa, amgamba, <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />“Aho mntu akutendela na kwika cheliso cha kumsenta mntu kwa Zumbe, nalavye yombe idiya dikuligana. <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />Wazwa naditende kwa mgosi, kukongela mihilimo milongo midi kubula mihilimo milongo mtandatu, wazwa dyako naditende hela milongo mishano za hantu hakukile. <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />Uneva ni mvyele mliganyo ni shilingi milongo mitatu. <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />Uneva mntu ana mihilimo mishano hegu milongo midi, mwikie mliganyo wa mgosi kwa shilingi milongo midi na kwa mvyele kwa shilingi mlongo. <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />Uneva mhilimo ni kulaila mwezi umwenga na mihilimo mishano, mwikie mliganyo wa mgosi kwa shilingi shano za hela, na kwa mvyele mliganyo ni shilingi ntatu za hela. <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />Uneva ni mntu wa mihilimo milongo mtandatu hegu kujinka, mliganyo wakwe kwa mgosi ni shilingi mlongo na shano kwa mvyele ni shilingi mlongo.”<verse eid="LEV 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />Uneva mntu uyo ni mchiwa hakudaha kuliha idiyombe, egalwe kulongozi kwa mlavyantambiko. Mlavyantambiko naike chihimo kuligana na udahi wa uyo ekiye icheliso.<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />Uneva cheliso chenye chaunga mnyama wadya wantu wakwigala kutenda lavyo kwa Zumbe, chila yumwenga mwa wanyama awo nalavigwe kwa Zumbe, zitende zikuka. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Uyo hahituile kwa yedi kwa ihiye hegu aihiye kwa ywedi. Uneva yumwenga anahituilwa kwa mnyama mtuhu, wose waidi nawatende wakuka. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Uneva ni ya mnyama yoyose hekuwagila, yudya hekungwa kwigalwa kulavigwa kwa Zumbe, ivyo, namwike umnyama uyo kulongozi kwa mlavyantambiko, <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />mlavyantambiko naike yombe, ikatenda ni yedi hegu iha. Mlavyantambiko namwikie chihimo, nicho nachitende. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Mna uneva aunga kumkombola, naho naongezeze ntendele ya shano kwa uwazwa wikigwe.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />Mntu anaika inyumbakwe ikukile kwa Zumbe, mlavyantambiko nakante idiyombe dyakwe kuligana no utana hegu wihi wakwe. Ivyo nakante nivyo navitende. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Na uneva mntu uyo aikie inyumbakwe itende ikuka uneva akaunga kuikombola, imwe ya shano nayongezezezwe kwe diyombe dikigwe, ivyo naitende yakwe.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />Uneva mntu anaika isanga ya wantu we ikaya yakwe ikukile kwa Zumbe, yombe dyakwe na dihimwe kuligana na mbeyu zingile mokuhanda inkonde iyo kwa chila chilo milongo midi ya shaili yombe dyakwe naditende shilingi milongo mishano ya hela. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Uneva mntu anaika inkonde yakwe itende ikuka mo mhilimo we ngasu, yombe ditende ivyo. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Mna uneva kaika inkonde yakwe ukuka ikomboka ingasu, mlavyantambiko na muwazize idiyobe dyakwe kuligana no uwazwa we mihilimo idya isigale kubula mhilimo we ngasu, na idiyombe dyakwe nadihunguzwe. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Na uneva yumwenga yudya aikie inkonde ukuka akaunga kuikombola, naongezeze ntele ya shano ya hela zo uwazwa wakwe naitende yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Mna uneva inkonde haikombolwe, hegu uneva itagwa kwa mntu mtuhu, haikombolwe. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Mna aho inkonde nailekelwe mwe ngasu, naitende ikuka kwa Zumbe enga nkonde yasigwe naitende ya mlavyantambiko.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />Uneva msiku anaika ukuka kwa Zumbe nkonde idya agwile, idya siyo yakwe ya ulisi, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />mlavyantambiko naike yombe dyakwe kubula mhilimo we ngasu, na <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Mo mhilimo we ngasu nkonde iyo nayuye kwa yudya aigulaga, kugamba yudya endile isi yendaga yakwe.<verse eid="LEV 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />Mayombe yose yaikwe kwa shilingi za hantu hakukile hela milongo midi nazitende shilingi.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />Mwelekwa ywa nkongo ywa wanyama, hasentwe kwa Zumbe, kwaviya uyo ni ywa Zumbe.<verse eid="LEV 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />“Uneva ni mnyama mzavu, na mguhe saviya aikigwe, akongezezwa imwe ya shano uneva hakombolwe, naho natagwe kuligana naivyo aikiwe.”<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />“Hahana yoyose natage hegu kugula chakwe aikie kwa Zumbe, chitende mntu hegu mnyama hegu si, nachitende cha Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Mntu yoyose akantilwe kukomwavyaungwa akomwe, asekulekelwa.”<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />“Mafungu ya mlongo yose yo uvuni yakulaila mwe zinkonde, yakatenda mbeyu kulaila mwe si, hegu matuda ya kulaila mwe miti, ni ya Zumbe, yakuka kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Uneva mntu akaunga akombole chochose mwe mafungu yakwe ya mlongo, aungwa alihe yombe dyakwe na chongezeko cha fungu dimwenga mwe mafungu mashashano. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Fungu dimwenga mwe mafungu mlongo yatende ya ng'ombe hegu ngoto, chila mnyama natende ni mkuka kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Mntu yoyose asekuza kugamba umnyama uyo ni ywedi hegu kaiha, naho uyo mnyama hahituilwe kwa mtuhu. Uneva anahituilwa kwa mtuhu wanyama wose waidi nawatende wakuka, hawakombolwe.”<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Yano nayo malagizo Zumbe amwinkile Musa kwa wana Waizulaeli ko Lugulu lwa Sinai.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>